     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いつのこととは　わからんが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神が　このジパングを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おつくりに　なったとき</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>No one knows when it was, but in the age when the Gods created Jipang,</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F383]=[.I383]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
