     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x147F-0x47_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神主さまなら　封印を　解く方法を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">知っているかもしれません</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神主のところへ　早く行ってください</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The priest might know a way to break the seal. You should head to the shrine at once.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
