    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>雲切の里２</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Kumogiri Hamlet 2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F449]=[.I449]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0xF1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　雲切の里２です</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-san, this is Kumogiri Hamlet 2.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F450]=[.I450]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0xF1_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切のおやぶんが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">宿の中で　お待ちです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri is waiting for you inside the inn.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F451]=[.I451]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x13E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切の　おやぶんは　ふたたび<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">マサカドが　復活し</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族が　立ち上がる日が</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri founded Kumogiri Hamlets all over the country as beacons of justice,</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F452]=[.I452]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x13E_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>来るやもしれんと　全国に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">雲切の里という　正義のとりでを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おつくりに　なられたのさ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>in case Masakado were to return and the Fire Clan rise up against him!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F453]=[.I453]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x13E_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切のおやぶんは　あんたみたいに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族の　血は　ひいてないけど</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">正義の心は　少しも　おとらないぜ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri may not be a descendant of the Fire Clan like you, but none can deny his love for justice!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F454]=[.I454]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x242_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教が　巣喰う　水戸町は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この里の　北の湖の　むこう側だ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Daimonists are using Mito Town as their base. It&apos;s just north from here, beyond the lake.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F455]=[.I455]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x242_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あの町は　大門教が　入ってから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんだか　人のようすが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かわっちまった！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Everyone there has been acting weird ever since!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F456]=[.I456]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x2C7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうやら　水戸町は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もとどおりに　なったみたいですね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mito Town is finally back to normal.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F457]=[.I457]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x2FF_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>黄門さまを　追い出して<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水戸城を　占領した</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のボスは　ゴーモンって名だ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Koumon-sama was kicked out of Mito Castle by Goumon, one of the heads of the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F458]=[.I458]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro16">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x2FF_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>名前の通り　人を　拷問するのが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">三度のメシより　好きらしい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんて　エグいやつだ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>He&apos;s a violent man who loves torturing people!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: the original line says &quot;just like his name implies&quot;. That&apos;s because &quot;Goumon&quot; and &quot;torture&quot; (<text:span text:style-name="T2">拷問</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, goumon) have the same pronunciation.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F459]=[.I459]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x3A1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教に　入れば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">不老不死に　なれるといって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">信者を　集めているらしい</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>It seems the Cult of Daimon is gathering believers by telling them that if they join, they can become immortal.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F460]=[.I460]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x3E7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさまで　ごぜえますか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">雲切のおやぶんさんは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あなたが来るのを　待ちわびています</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri has been expecting you, Ziria-sama.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F461]=[.I461]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x14EF-0x3E7_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ご自分の　あみだした技を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさまに　さずけるんだと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たいそうな　ハリキリようですよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>He looks forward to teaching you one of the techniques he designed!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F462]=[.I462]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x150B</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>宿屋</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F111])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Inn" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Inn</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F111]); COLUMN([.F111]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F111" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F111</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x8D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんたは　小さかったから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おぼえてないかも　しれないけどさ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You were probably too young to remember, but...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F465]=[.I465]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x8D_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切のおやぶんも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたみたいに　ガマ仙人の元に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いたことが　あるらしいよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri was once a pupil of the Toad Hermit, just like you.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F466]=[.I466]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x8D_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切のおやぶんは　ガキのあんたを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひとめ見て　あんたが　将来</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の勇者になると　確信したらしいよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Apparently, when you were very young, he took one look at you and concluded that one day you&apos;d become a Fire Hero.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F467]=[.I467]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おお　やっと　来たか　ジライア！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おれだよ　雲切だ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ずいぶん　りっぱに　なったもんだ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Here you are, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>It&apos;s me, Kumogiri!\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;ve really grown!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F468]=[.I468]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんたが　火の勇者として<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　デーモンたちと　戦うなら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かならずや　ちからになるぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you&apos;re going up against the demons of the Cult of Daimon, I&apos;ll be behind you all the way!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F469]=[.I469]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ガマ仙人との　約束なんだ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">だが　それだけじゃねえ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のやつらが　ゆるせねえのさ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Not just because I promised the Toad Hermit, but because those damn Daimonists have crossed the line!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F470]=[.I470]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>人の弱味に　つけこんで　信者にさせ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あげくに　たましいを　ぬき取るなど</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まったく　ヒデエ　話だぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They exploit people&apos;s weaknesses to turn them into their followers, and then they take their souls! They&apos;re utter slime!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F471]=[.I471]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_13</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それを　なんとか　できるのは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライア！！　火の勇者である</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたしか　いませんぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria! Only you, a Fire Hero, can put an end to their evil!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F472]=[.I472]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x173_16</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さあ　おれの　あみだした技を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おしえよう！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">戦いのとき　使ってくだせえ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Allow me to teach you a technique of my own design.\n</text:p><text:p>You can use it in battle!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F473]=[.I473]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x3C1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「ぬすむ」の技を　おぼえた！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria has learned how to steal!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F474]=[.I474]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x3F2_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんたが　火の勇者として<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　デーモンたちと　戦うなら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かならずや　ちからになるぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F469])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="If you&apos;re going up against the demons of the Cult of Daimon, I&apos;ll be behind you all the way!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you&apos;re going up against the demons of the Cult of Daimon, I&apos;ll be behind you all the way!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F469]); COLUMN([.F469]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F469" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F469</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x3F2_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ガマ仙人との　約束なんだ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">だが　それだけじゃねえ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のやつらが　ゆるせねえのさ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F470])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Not just because I promised the Toad Hermit, but because those damn Daimonists have crossed the line!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Not just because I promised the Toad Hermit, but because those damn Daimonists have crossed the line!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F470]); COLUMN([.F470]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F470" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F470</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x3F2_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>人の弱味に　つけこんで　信者にさせ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あげくに　たましいを　ぬき取るなど</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まったく　ヒデエ　話だぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F471])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="They exploit people&apos;s weaknesses to turn them into their followers, and then they take their souls! They&apos;re utter slime!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They exploit people&apos;s weaknesses to turn them into their followers, and then they take their souls! They&apos;re utter slime!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F471]); COLUMN([.F471]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F471" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F471</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x3F2_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それを　なんとか　できるのは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライア！！　火の勇者である</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたしか　いませんぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F472])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Ziria! Only you, a Fire Hero, can put an end to their evil!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria! Only you, a Fire Hero, can put an end to their evil!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F472]); COLUMN([.F472]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F472" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F472</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x58A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切のおやぶんの　命令で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水戸城に　しのびこんで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">今　けえってきたところなんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Chief Kumogiri ordered me to infiltrate Castle Mito. I just got back.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F479]=[.I479]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x58A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうやら　水戸城の地下には<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ばんもう国に　ぬける道が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あるらしいんだよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Apparently, there&apos;s a secret path to the lands of Banmou under the castle.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F480]=[.I480]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x150B-0x638_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
