    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x155F-0x60_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　大門教を　やっつけるために<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぬすっとを　養成する</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">通称　ぬすっと訓練所です！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F307])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="This is a Thieving School, where you can improve your thievery in order to help defeat the Cult of Daimon!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>This is a Thieving School, where you can improve your thievery in order to help defeat the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F307]); COLUMN([.F307]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F307" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F307</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x155F-0x60_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>奥の　部屋に　入って<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">教官を　よけて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つづらの中の　お金を　とるんです！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F308])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Head inside, avoid the instructors, and steal the money from the casket!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Head inside, avoid the instructors, and steal the money from the casket!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F308]); COLUMN([.F308]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F308" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F308</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x155F-0xFD_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みごと　お金を　とることに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">成功したら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そのお金は　あなたのものです！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F309])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="If you can steal the money successfully, you get to keep it for yourself!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you can steal the money successfully, you get to keep it for yourself!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F309]); COLUMN([.F309]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F309" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F309</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x155F-0xFD_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>まあ　遊びだと　おもって<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">気軽に　たのしんでくださいよ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">だけど　マサカド打倒も　お忘れなく！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F310])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Think of it as a game and have fun!\n&#x0a;But don&apos;t forget your quest to defeat Masakado!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Think of it as a game and have fun!\n</text:p><text:p>But don&apos;t forget your quest to defeat Masakado!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
