     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x16E7-0xDB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>黄門の野郎は　ゴーモンさまに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">城を　追ん出されて　いまごろ　どこで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">泣いてることやら・・・へっへっへ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That Koumon fool has been driven out of the castle by Goumon-sama. Bet he&apos;s off crying in some shack. Heh heh heh!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F667]=[.I667]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
