    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x173B-0xDB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　悪くいう　ふとどきものは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゴーモンさまに　性根を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たたき　なおしてもらえば　いいんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Goumon-sama should beat the crap out of those fools who speak ill of the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F679]=[.I679]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x173B-0x139_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>胎内洞へ　行く前に　とらわれている<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">村人たちを　助けてやってくださいね</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とくに　若い女を　先にね・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F538])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Please save the villagers before you go through Innards Grotto.\n&#x0a;Especially the young ladies..." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Please save the villagers before you go through Innards Grotto.\n</text:p><text:p>Especially the young ladies...</text:p>
