      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x181B-0x3A5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オレは　大タヌキ様の　子分だ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホテイ丸は　つづらに　とじこめた</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえは　ここで　おわりだ　ポン！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m a follower of the Great Tanuki!\n</text:p><text:p>Hoteimaru is inside the casket.\n</text:p><text:p>This is your end, pon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
