     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>橋が　こわれていて<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">向こう側に　渡ることは　できない</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The bridge is broken.\n</text:p><text:p>There is no way to reach the other side.</text:p>
