     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x1ACF</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1ACF-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>民家</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F129])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="House" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>House</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F129]); COLUMN([.F129]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F129" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F129</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1ACF-0x4B_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>男に　力じゃ　かなわんと　思ったとき<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">女は　うそなきを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">自然と　身につけるモンなのじゃよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>All women naturally know a way to send men into panic: crying crocodile tears.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F853]=[.I853]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro24">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1ACF-0x4B_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>つまり　おぬしの力が　ツナデより<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あきらかに　上まわらんかぎり</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデは　真のうそなきなど　せん！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When Tsunade cries crocodile tears, you never know what&apos;s going to <text:s/>happen!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: The literal translation here is something along the lines of: &quot;Women naturally cry crocodile tears when they feel they&apos;re weaker than a man. In other words, only if your strength surpasses that of Tsunade will she cry real crocodile tears!&quot; Considering how little sense this makes, I rewrote these lines to better reflect what happens in-game. I&apos;m considering adding somehow the &quot;level 35&quot; requirement but I&apos;m not sure how. Might be worth simply breaking the fourth wall, like that NPC that tells you to hold II to run.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F854]=[.I854]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro25">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1ACF-0x104_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ツナデは　三国一の　オノ使いじゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">他の者が　使うよりも</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オノの力が　もっと　強くなる！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tsunade is the best wielder of axes in the Far East. None can match her skill!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: I wrote &quot;Far East&quot; as a bit of a reference to the game title (Far East of Eden). The original line mentions <text:span text:style-name="T2">三国一</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, literally &quot;the best of the three kingdoms&quot;, idiomatically &quot;unparalled in Japan, China, and India&quot;. &quot;Three Kingdoms&quot; can&apos;t refer to the in-game countries because there are way more than 3. I think it&apos;s just the Japanese version of &quot;the best gun in the Wild West&quot;.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F855]=[.I855]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1ACF-0x104_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オノを　手に入れたら　まず<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデに　わたすのが　よかろう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you ever find an axe, let Tsunade wield it!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F856]=[.I856]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
