    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1AEB-0x3F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>伝説によれば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族の　勇者とは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ガマ　ナメクジ　そして</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>According to the old tales, the Fire Clan is comprised of multiple clans.\n</text:p><text:p>The Toad clan, the Slug clan, and...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F859]=[.I859]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1AEB-0x3F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そして　あと　ひとつの族は！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">えーと・・・・・・・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たしか・・・・・・・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>And...and the other one! It&apos;s the...\n</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T15">The uhm...\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T15">Uhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F860]=[.I860]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro26">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1AEB-0x3F_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>わすれて　しもうた・・</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sorry, I forgot...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>NOTE: the game does not put linebreaks after this line that would make it appear at the top of the box (possibly deliberately, possibly accidentally). after advancing to this line, what is shown in the box is:</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">えーと・・・・・・・・・</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たしか・・・・・・・・・</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わすれて　しもうた・・</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">so we should make sure the previous two lines aren&apos;t empty and look okay when shown at the same time as this one.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F861]=[.I861]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
