      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1B23-0x624_9</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あっ！　ごめん　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あたしって　そそっかしいから！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でも　首を　切らなくて　よかったね！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Whoops! Sorry &apos;bout that, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;m such a klutz! At least I didn&apos;t chop your head off, right? Hahaha!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTE: noting because zenki didn&apos;t: in the original, the laughter is only in the voice acting (quite possibly just because there wasn&apos;t room in the box to write it)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F924]=[.I924]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
