     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>キツネ　キツネじゃ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">それも　キツネ女じゃ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">苦しめられておる　姿が　見ゆる！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Kitsune! So many kitsune!\n</text:p><text:p>And a kitsune woman, too!\n</text:p><text:p>I can see suffering!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F939]=[.I939]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1B3F-0x277_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ウムッ！！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A lot of suffering!!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F940]=[.I940]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro28">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1B3F-0x277_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>こんなん　でましたけど〜！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...That doesn&apos;t sound good, huh?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>FIXME: there is a minor formatting error with this line in the original game that causes an extra empty box to display at the end, but it only &quot;sticks&quot; on screen if you release the I button quickly (which is probably why no one noticed it). input handling changes in the translation mean that it now always &quot;sticks&quot; and is very noticeable, so we should probably fix it at some point. all that&apos;s needed is to replace the BOXPAUSE() with a BOXEND()... but i don&apos;t want to modify the spec file by hand for maintainability reasons.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F941]=[.I941]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1B3F-0x32F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ミートの　瞬間！　ヘッドが　まがる！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">だから　ふつうの　オノでは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神木が　切れないんだ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Not even a professional lumberjack can cut down a sacred tree with just any old hatchet! You need a special axe for that!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F942]=[.I942]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
