      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1D8B-0x68_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん　じゃないですかぁ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こんな所で　遊んでいて　いいんですか</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まっ　たまには　息ぬきしないとね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F494])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="My, if it isn&apos;t Ziria-san!\n&#x0a;Should you really be here?\n&#x0a;Eh, I guess it&apos;s fine every once in a while!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>My, if it isn&apos;t Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>Should you really be here?\n</text:p><text:p>Eh, I guess it&apos;s fine every once in a while!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F494]); COLUMN([.F494]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F494" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F494</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1D8B-0xD0_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ツボふりの　ネエちゃん　きれいだろ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もう　ちょっとで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">見えそう　なんだけどなあ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F495])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="The dice lady is a real babe!\n&#x0a;When I play, I&apos;m not exactly looking at the dice, if you catch my drift!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The dice lady is a real babe!\n</text:p><text:p>When I play, I&apos;m not exactly looking at the dice, if you catch my drift!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F495]); COLUMN([.F495]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F495" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F495</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1D8B-0x124_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>二つの　サイコロの目を　たして<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">偶数なら　「丁」で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">奇数なら　「半」だ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F496])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s a simple game!\n&#x0a;Just bet whether the sum of the two dice will be even or odd!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s a simple game!\n</text:p><text:p>Just bet whether the sum of the two dice will be even or odd!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
