    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1DC3-0x3DD_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あっしは　大工のトウベイです！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白河城の　絵図面を　かくしたので</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">タマモに　とじこめられてました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m Toubei the carpenter.\n</text:p><text:p>Tamamo locked me in here after I hid the plans to Shirakawa Castle.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1145]=[.I1145]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1DC3-0x3DD_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>白河城の　絵図面は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここから　西の　犬神村の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">コマ犬の前に　うめてあります</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You&apos;ll find them buried under one of the Komainu statues in Inugami Village to the west.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1146]=[.I1146]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
