      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>木製の　さくのようなもので<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かぎは　かかっていない・・・と</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いうより　ついていません</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>There is a wooden fence.\n</text:p><text:p>It&apos;s unlocked...or rather, it doesn&apos;t even have a lock in the first place.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
