    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1DFB-0x70F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>だ　だ　大門教が<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白イヌさまを　石に変えてしまった！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こ　こ　この犬神村は　おしまいだ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Th-Th-The Cult of Daimon turned the sacred White Dog to stone!\n</text:p><text:p>I-I-It&apos;s the end of Inugami Village!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1177]=[.I1177]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x1DFB-0x769_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>石にされた　白イヌさまも　心配だけど<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さらわれた　トウベイさんの　ほうが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わたしは　ずっと　心配なのよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Everyone&apos;s worrying about the sacred White Dog, but I&apos;m more worried about Toubei-san&apos;s disappearance!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
