     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神社の前に　あった　コマ犬を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">村の入口まで　ズリズリって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">うごかしちゃたんだよ〜ん！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Komainu statues were in front of the shrine, but I pushed them to the village&apos;s entrance!</text:p>
