     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大トノの　スケベにも　こまったわい<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">タマモの　うなじをみて　ムラムラして</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">けっこんしたそうな！　わかいのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tamamo only had to show the lord a little nape to get him to marry her! Today&apos;s youth can only think with their pants!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1337]=[.I1337]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
