     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あぶくま洞から　かえってきた<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">タマモ姫が　いかり　くるって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">城に入って　いったのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tamamohime just returned from the Abukuma Caves. She looked livid as she headed inside the castle.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
