     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふるい　伝説に　よれば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">マサカドを　封じるには</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">聖なる　３つの玉が　いる</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>According to ancient legends, Masakado was sealed away with the power of three sacred orbs.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
