     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふるい　伝説に　よれば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あばれる　マサカドを　封じたのは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族じゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>According to ancient legends, it was the Fire Clan who stopped Masakado&apos;s rampage.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
