    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x21EC-0xFE_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ツナデって　女の子が　キコリに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なったんだって　いいなあ・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ベンキョーしなくて　いいんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Tsunade wants to become a lumberjack. That must be nice...\n</text:p><text:p>I don&apos;t want to study, either.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1503]=[.I1503]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
