     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2240-0xCC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　神のオノは　むかし<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ナメクジ仙人から　もらったのじゃが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデなら　つかえる　はずじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Slug Hermit left the God Axe in our care. I&apos;m sure Tsunade can wield it.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1536]=[.I1536]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
