     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x25A0-0xB7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ネズミたいじは　ねこま神社と<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">聞いたが　どこに　あるんだろう？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The Nekoma Shrine is supposed to be great for eliminating rats.\n</text:p><text:p>But where could it be?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F1759]=[.I1759]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
