      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x28B0-0x124_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ちかごろ　ふぬけた　武士どもばかりで<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ウデが　なまって　おったところだ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おぬしは　どうかな？　では　ゆくぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I haven&apos;t faced any real challenges lately.\n</text:p><text:p>I was starting to lose my edge! Hopefully you shall prove worthy...Have at you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
