     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　大門教を　やっつけるために<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぬすっとを　養成すまる</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">通称　ぬすっと訓練所です！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>This is the Thieving School, where you will learn a useful skill to help you in your quest to defeat the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
