      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I think most of the text from here to the next big map (map 0x2FA8) is unused text from the previous version of the game. The &quot;Snake Spring Cave&quot; has been renamed &quot;Snake Hermit Cave&quot;, and Takkoku-no-Iwaya was where King Akurou (who was depicted as an evil warlord) came from.</text:p>
