    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2B6B-0x5EE_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>よくやりました　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">私はあなたの活躍を　影で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">見守っていました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F1571])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Well done, Ziria!\n&#x0a;I&apos;ve been observing your exploits in secret." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Well done, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;ve been observing your exploits in secret.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F1571]); COLUMN([.F1571]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F1571" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F1571</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2B6B-0x5EE_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あなたが死んだと思っている<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">悪路王と　その子供は</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">私が助けました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I saved Akuro-Ou and his child from certain death.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2229]=[.I2229]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2B6B-0x5EE_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さぁ・・・　勇者の力で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教をたおすのです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F1573])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Young hero...Do not stop until the Cult of Daimon is no more." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Young hero...Do not stop until the Cult of Daimon is no more.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F1573]); COLUMN([.F1573]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F1573" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F1573</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2B6B-0x5EE_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もはや　すべての橋は渡れるはず・・<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行きなさい　ジライア！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Now you can cross every bridge.\n</text:p><text:p>Go forth, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2231]=[.I2231]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
