     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2B87-0xF8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>北の　橋を　わたると　たが城だぜ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オニより　こわい　あくろう王が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いるんだ・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Cross the northern bridge and you&apos;ll reach Taga Castle. King Akurou is scarier than the Oni...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
