     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2BA3-0x120_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あくろう王は　もとは　りくう国の王で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いいやつ　だったんだが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　入会しちまってよ・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F1603])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="King Akurou used to be the just ruler of Rikuu, but then he joined the Cult of Daimon..." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>King Akurou used to be the just ruler of Rikuu, but then he joined the Cult of Daimon...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F1603]); COLUMN([.F1603]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F1603" calcext:value-type="string">
