      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2BF7-0xD3_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いってらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お気をつけて　ジライアさま</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F124])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F124]); COLUMN([.F124]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F124" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F124</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2BF7-0x106_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>白いネコは　ネズミを　封じると<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">聞いたが　どこに　いるのか・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I heard the White Cat can seal the rats, but nobody knows where he is now.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2267]=[.I2267]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2BF7-0x147_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>西に　ある　ねこまた神社に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまいりに　行ったけど</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神社が　みつからなくて・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I went to pay my respects to Nekomata Shrine, to the west, but I couldn&apos;t find the actual shrine...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2268]=[.I2268]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
