      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2C83-0x42D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>聞いてくれ！　おれの　命は　いらん<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ただ　おれの　子供を　助けたい！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">その　チャンスを　ねらって</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I don&apos;t care about my life, but I want to save my son! I&apos;ve been following Danjou&apos;s orders while waiting for an opportunity.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
