      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2C9F-0x3D6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ネズミに　米を　ぬすまれたわ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あくろう王様が　しっかり　しない</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">からよ！　まったく・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Rats stole all our rice! Why isn&apos;t King Akurou doing anything?!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2333]=[.I2333]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
