     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2C9F-0x434_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あくろう王様は　城の中さ・・・<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">会っても　しかたないぜ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まあ　行って　みなされ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>King Akurou is inside. I doubt he&apos;d be willing to talk, but...Well, go ahead.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
