     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>まあ　どんな世界に　なろうと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">商売が　うまくいけば</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かんけい　ないけどね！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I don&apos;t care who rules the world.\n</text:p><text:p>Business is business!</text:p>
