    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro29">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ブクブク・・・・あんまり　長い間<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">暗いとこに　閉じ込めるもんやから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ビビって　アワ吹いてしもうたがな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Blub blub...Oh, sorry. I&apos;ve been in this darkness for far too long.\n</text:p><text:p>I was so surprised I started foaming!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the White Crab speaks in Oosaka-ben, most likely because Osaka is famous for its crabs (Dotonbori&apos;s Kani Doraku, in Osaka, is a very iconic restaurant, with a giant crab statue outside)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2396]=[.I2396]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それはそうと　火の勇者よ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教とて　自分らだけで　ジパングを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">支配できる　力は　もっとらん！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Anyway, listen! The Cult of Daimon by itself doesn&apos;t have the power to fully take over Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2397]=[.I2397]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>だから　あやつらは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">すべてを　破壊しつくす　マサカドの</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">強大な　霊力が　ほしいんや！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That&apos;s why they&apos;re trying to revive Masakado! They want his devastating spiritual power!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2398]=[.I2398]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いそぐんや！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえに　わしの　神通力を　しるした</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">雲海の巻物を　やるで！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>There&apos;s no time to waste! I&apos;m going to bestow upon you the scroll of Unkai, which contains my divine power!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2399]=[.I2399]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_8</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲海の術はな　自分のまわりに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ブクブクーっと　きりを　まきちらして</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">一人の　敵の目を　くらます術や！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The Unkai jutsu releases a mist that will blind a single enemy!\n</text:p><text:p>Your very own crab foam, blub blub!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2400]=[.I2400]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0x866_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　いてもうたれ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">マサカドを　復活させては　あかん！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行け！　行くんや　ジライア！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Take down the Cult of Daimon!\n</text:p><text:p>Don&apos;t let them revive Masakado!\n</text:p><text:p>You can do it, kiddo!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2401]=[.I2401]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro7">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0xA83_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>神獣白カニの　封印を　解き放った</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You have broken the seal of the divine beast White Crab.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2402]=[.I2402]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x2FA8-0xAA9_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>雲海の巻物を　手に入れた</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Obtained Scroll of Unkai.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2403]=[.I2403]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
