     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Daimon Church</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTE: should be &quot;Tsukiyama Daimon Church&quot;, but that&apos;s too long and gets squished to near-unreadability. no other daimon church gets its own label like this, so it&apos;s not too big a deal.</text:p>
