     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>やっと　ここまで　きおったな！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どうや　毒の水は　うまかろう</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さいごに　たっぷり　のましたる</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Here ya are! Sure kept me waitin&apos;!\n</text:p><text:p>Didja enjoy all that delicious toxic water? C&apos;mon, have a taste!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F2739]=[.I2739]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
