     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3424-0x124_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>二つの　サイコロの目を　たして<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">偶数なら　「丁」で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">奇数なら　「半」だ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F496])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s a simple game!\n&#x0a;Just bet whether the sum of the two dice will be even or odd!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s a simple game!\n</text:p><text:p>Just bet whether the sum of the two dice will be even or odd!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F496]); COLUMN([.F496]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F496" calcext:value-type="string">
