     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>サルたちが　あばれているのは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きっと　大門教の　せいさ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤツラの　やりそうな　ことだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I bet the Cult of Daimon is behind the monkeys&apos; rampage. I mean, that&apos;s just the kind of thing they&apos;d do, right?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
