     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>鏡が　おいてある<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おや？　鏡の中に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">サルの怪物と　少女が　写っている</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s a mirror.\n</text:p><text:p>Hold on...The reflection shows a monkey monster and a young lady.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
