     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3654-0x262_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ううう・・・　ジャマを　しているぞ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まず　かんざしじゃ　かんざし！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かんざしが　みいらの・・・　ううう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ahhh...It stands in your way!\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;ll need a hairpin! With that hairpin, the mummy can...Ahhh...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3029]=[.I3029]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
