     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>よーく　あたるぞ！　ヒヒヒヒ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">占うかい？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>My predictions are often right, heeheehee! Should I read your fortune?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
