      <text:p>map-0x3654-0x3ED_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あたるも　はっけ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あたらぬも　はっけ・・よいよい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">へへへ　占うかい？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>My predictions may not always be right, but they&apos;re never wrong, hehehe!\n</text:p><text:p>Should I read your fortune?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
