     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんた　だけに　おしえるが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かんざしは　つちざき城の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぼうさんが　もっているのさ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Let me tell you a secret.\n</text:p><text:p>The monk from Tsuchizaki Castle has a special hairpin.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
