     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x36E0-0x50_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>つき山には　３つの　山が　あってのう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">むかしから　そこに　どくの水が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わきでていると　いわれておる</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mount Tsukiyama has three peaks. According to old tales, toxic water would flow down from there.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
