     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3915-0x517_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ホーホー！　ね・・・ねむい！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしゃ　神の使い　白フクロウじゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしゃ　夜行性動物なんじゃぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoot-hoot! So...So sleepy...\n</text:p><text:p>I am the White Owl, messenger of the divine!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3108]=[.I3108]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
