     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3915-0x517_18</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おまえに　わしの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神通力をしるした　淡雲の巻物を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さずけねば　ならんのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;ll bestow upon you the scroll of Awagumo, which contains my divine power.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
