     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>淡雲の術は　全ての敵を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">うすい雲で　包み　幻を見せて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">目を　くらます術じゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Awagumo jutsu will wrap all of your enemies in a thin fog that will show them illusions, blocking their sight!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3118]=[.I3118]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3915-0x517_22</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！　おまえの　けんとうを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">祈っておるぞ！　それじゃ　わしは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　ねる！　ムニャムニャ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;ll pray for your victory, Ziria.\n</text:p><text:p>And now, back to sleep!\n</text:p><text:p>...Zzz...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3119]=[.I3119]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
