     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！　おまえの　けんとうを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">祈っておるぞ！　それじゃ　わしは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　ねる！　ムニャムニャ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3119])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="I&apos;ll pray for your victory, Ziria.\n&#x0a;And now, back to sleep!\n&#x0a;...Zzz..." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;ll pray for your victory, Ziria.\n</text:p><text:p>And now, back to sleep!\n</text:p><text:p>...Zzz...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
