     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>南の　松本城の　信玄さまは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ニセモノだって　ウワサだぜ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　大門教かねぇ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Rumor is the Shingen-sama in Matsumoto Castle is an impostor.\n</text:p><text:p>The Cult of Daimon is at it again, huh?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
