     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>こうふ城の　グロヌシさまが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">勇者に会いてえ！　勇者に会いてえ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">と　ネゴトに　いっているとさ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I heard that Lord Guronushi of Koufu Castle wants to meet the heroes so badly that he even talks about it in his sleep!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
