     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>全身　黒ずくめの男が　立っている<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どうやら　敵意は　ないようだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A man completely covered in black stands before you. He doesn&apos;t seem to bear any ill will.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
