     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>クククク・・・　きたな　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教１３人衆の　６番手</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この　ドーマンを　おこらせたな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Heh heh...I&apos;ve been waiting for you, Ziria! You&apos;ve incurred the wrath of Douman, the sixth of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
