     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>預かり所</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F196])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Warehouse" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Warehouse</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F196]); COLUMN([.F196]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F196" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F196</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x3F51</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0xAF_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>甲府城</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Koufu Castle</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3643]=[.I3643]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x1B7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライア殿　ホテイ丸から　きいてます<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあ　おくで　グロヌシさまが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お待ちして　おります！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-dono! Hoteimaru told us about you. Guronushi-sama is waiting for you inside!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3644]=[.I3644]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x213_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ホテイ丸は　ジパングの　ヒミツを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">調べるとか　いって　穴を　ぬけて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ふじ国へ　行きました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoteimaru crossed the tunnel to Fuji.\n</text:p><text:p>He said something about looking for the secret of Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3645]=[.I3645]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x26B_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あなたが　勇者ですか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホテイ丸から　きいて　おります</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ともに　がんばりましょう！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hoteimaru told us about you, young hero! We stand together against the Daimonists!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3646]=[.I3646]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x2BD_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>これで　安心は　できません！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教は　すでに　江戸城を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おさえたと　ききました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>There&apos;s no time to celebrate!\n</text:p><text:p>Reports say that the Cult of Daimon has occupied Edo Castle!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3647]=[.I3647]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x30D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>グロヌシさまの　命令で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">塩山の　北の堤防を　きって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水浸しに　してやりました！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Under Guronushi-sama&apos;s orders, we built an embankment north of the Salt Pyramid and launched a flood attack!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3648]=[.I3648]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x30D_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　たおす　ためなら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんでもやる　かくごです！！！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;re not pulling any punches in our battle against the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3649]=[.I3649]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x39C_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしが　タケダ一族の　グロヌシだ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やっと　来て　くれたな！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の勇者！　待ちわびておったぞ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I am Guronushi of the Takeda Clan!\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;ve been waiting for you, Fire Hero!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3650]=[.I3650]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x39C_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしは　このジパングを　愛しとる！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">だから　大門教と　戦っているのだが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">すこしばかり　根性が　たりんのじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I love Jipang! That is why I stand against the Cult of Daimon...But alas, my will is not quite strong enough!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3651]=[.I3651]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x39C_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうも　塩が　にがてで　塩山に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行けぬ！！　ニセ信玄の　ドーマンの</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かくれがが　その　塩山だというのに！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Due to my salt allergy, I cannot chase Shingen&apos;s impersonator, Douman, inside the Salt Pyramid!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3652]=[.I3652]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x39C_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>塩山の北のスミを　くずしておいた！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そこから　なかに　入れるはずじゃ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たのむ　ドーマンを　たおしてくれ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;ve broken through the pyramid&apos;s north wall. You should be able to enter from there. Please, take down Douman!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3653]=[.I3653]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x564_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>塩山の北のスミを　くずしておいた！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そこから　なかに　入れるはずじゃ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たのむ　ドーマンを　たおしてくれ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3653])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="We&apos;ve broken through the pyramid&apos;s north wall. You should be able to enter from there. Please, take down Douman!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;ve broken through the pyramid&apos;s north wall. You should be able to enter from there. Please, take down Douman!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F3653]); COLUMN([.F3653]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F3653" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F3653</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro17">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x5E0_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>うむ！　伝説は　ほんとう　だった！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やはり　火の勇者だけの　ことはある</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The tales were true: you ARE the Fire Heroes!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: this is used when you talk to Guronushi after defeating Douman</text:p><text:p>Supper: as a random aside, if you beat Douman and get the Slug Orb, then die and get sent back without retrieving Tsunade, you&apos;ll still get this dialogue...but the tunnel remains incomplete, so you can&apos;t move on without her.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3655]=[.I3655]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x5E0_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしが　つくらせた　ぬけ穴から<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングの　ヒミツが　かくされた</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士国へ　ぬけられる</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You can use the tunnel to reach the lands of Fuji, where the secret of Jipang is hidden.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3656]=[.I3656]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x5E0_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ホテイ丸は　先に　いったぞ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあ　行きなされ　火の勇者たちよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoteimaru already left.\n</text:p><text:p>Go forth, young Fire Heroes!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3657]=[.I3657]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F51-0x6E3_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>うむ！　伝説は　ほんとう　だった！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やはり　火の勇者だけの　ことはある</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3655])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="The tales were true: you ARE the Fire Heroes!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The tales were true: you ARE the Fire Heroes!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F3655]); COLUMN([.F3655]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F3655" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F3655</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x3F6D</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0xB6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ぬけ道</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tunnel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3660]=[.I3660]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro49">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x148_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おっかちゃんのためなら　エーンヤコラ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">グロヌシさまのためなら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">エーンヤコーラア！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, I dig for mom and dad! I dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, I do it for my lord!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: <text:span text:style-name="T2">エンヤコラ </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">is something you say to give yourself the right timing to do something (like digging, pushing, etc).</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">I based this on the Seven Dwarves&apos; song from the famous Snow White cartoon.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3661]=[.I3661]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x19A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それ　ホレ！　やれ　ホレ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どんどん　ホレ！　もっと　ホレ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">えんやさ　のさ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>We will make a tunnel\n</text:p><text:p>with our dig, dig, digging,\n</text:p><text:p>we can work all day!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I took inspiration from a nursery rhyme called &quot;Dig dig digging&quot;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3662]=[.I3662]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x1EC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>穴ほりゃ！　向こうは　富士の国！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングのため　大門教打倒のため</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">全身全霊を　かけて　掘ってます！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;re opening a tunnel to the lands of Fuji! For the sake of Jipang, we&apos;re going to dig with everything we&apos;ve got!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3663]=[.I3663]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x250_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ザクっと　ザクっと　ザックっと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ザクっと　ザクっと　ザックっと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ザクっと　ザクっと　ザックっとな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Dig, and dig, and dig,\n</text:p><text:p>and dig, and dig, and dig,\n</text:p><text:p>and dig some more!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3664]=[.I3664]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x2B2_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ホーレホレ！　ホーレホレ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もひとつ　おまけに！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホーレホレ！　ホーレホレ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Dig, dig, dig, goes the shovel,\n</text:p><text:p>dig, dig, digging all day long...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I based this one on a children song called &quot;Dig dig dig goes the digger&quot;.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3665]=[.I3665]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x300_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ちかれたー！　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あと　どのくらい　掘ればいいんだろ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">急がないと！　ヨイショ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>So TIRED! Are we there yet?!\n</text:p><text:p>...No, I have to keep it together.\n</text:p><text:p>Back to digging!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3666]=[.I3666]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x350_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オー！　フレンド！　ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゴメンね！　ワタシよ！　ホテイ丸ヨ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いろいろ　ベリーベリー　いそがしいネ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh, friend! Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>Sorry! It is me! Hoteimaru!\n</text:p><text:p>Now am very very busy!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>CHECK, Hoteimaru&apos;s accent</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3667]=[.I3667]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x350_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教が　かなり　ひろまってるヨ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ワタシ　ここでも　大門教　やっつける</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">てつだいネ！　がんばってるんダヨ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Cult of Daimon, everywhere!\n</text:p><text:p>Am here to help beat Cult of Daimon!\n</text:p><text:p>Work hard!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3668]=[.I3668]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x350_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>富士国に　ぬける穴　ほってマス！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士国　ジパングの　たいせつネ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんた　グロヌシさんに　あうヨロシ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Dig tunnel to Fuji!\n</text:p><text:p>Fuji, important to Jipang!\n</text:p><text:p>Say hi to Guronushi-san!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3669]=[.I3669]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x3F6D-0x4AD_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>富士国に　ぬける穴　ほってマス！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士国　ジパングの　たいせつネ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんた　グロヌシさんに　あうヨロシ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3669])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Dig tunnel to Fuji!\n&#x0a;Fuji, important to Jipang!\n&#x0a;Say hi to Guronushi-san!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Dig tunnel to Fuji!\n</text:p><text:p>Fuji, important to Jipang!\n</text:p><text:p>Say hi to Guronushi-san!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F3669]); COLUMN([.F3669]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F3669" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F3669</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
