     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　あさま神社は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神主と　ミコだけが　いる</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とくべつな　ところじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only priests and shrine maidens live here in Asama Shrine.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
