     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>やっと　来ましたね　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神は　この地に　おりられ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神獣を　お創りに　なったのです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome, Ziria! This is where the Gods descended to create the divine beasts.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3711]=[.I3711]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x29D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>富士山の　地下には<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白リュウさまが　おられるのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The sacred White Dragon dwells deep within Mount Fuji.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3712]=[.I3712]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x2D1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あなたが　大門教から　たすけた<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神獣たちは　とくべつの日</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この　富士に　あつまるのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The divine beasts you free from the Daimonists&apos; clutches will gather in Fuji on a special day.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3713]=[.I3713]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x327_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神聖な　富士山を　大門教が　けがし<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">クモで　いっぱいに・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">聖なる　山を　取り戻すのじゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I can&apos;t believe those Daimonist spiders would defile the sacred Mount Fuji...Please, free it from this evil presence!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3714]=[.I3714]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x385_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>よくやった　ジライア！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これからも　ジパングのために</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">戦うのじゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Well done, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Keep up the good fight for the sake of Jipang!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3715]=[.I3715]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x3CB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神獣は　よい力を　はぐくみ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この国を　正しく　</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">みちびいて　いるのじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The divine beasts nurture the power of good, leading Jipang down the right path!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3716]=[.I3716]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x413_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>富士山の　火口の底には<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白リュウさまの</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">九つの神殿が　あるのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Deep inside the crater of Mount Fuji are the Nine Temples of the White Dragon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3717]=[.I3717]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro14">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x413_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこへ行くには<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士山のふもとの　鳥居から</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">頂上めざし　火口に入ればよい</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>To enter the crater, first cross the sacred archway at the bottom of Mount Fuji and make your way to its summit.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the specific term is &quot;torii&quot;, but since this is the only time it&apos;s mentioned in the game, I figured calling it a &quot;sacred archway&quot; would be easier to understand for the players.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3718]=[.I3718]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x49A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジパングの民が　あやうき　とき<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つねに　火の一族の勇者が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">立ち上がって　きたのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Whenever a threat looms over Jipang, the Fire Heroes shall rise.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3719]=[.I3719]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x4EC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>白リュウさまは　富士の奥底で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の勇者の為に　三つの巻物を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お守りになっておるのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The sacred White Dragon is safeguarding three scrolls deep within Fuji.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3720]=[.I3720]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x4EC_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>白リュウさまは　九つの神殿の<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">中央の大神殿に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いらっしゃいます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The sacred White Dragon is inside the Great Temple, at the center of the Nine Temples.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I think the point is that the Great Temple is the central temple of the Nine Temples, not an additional tenth temple.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3721]=[.I3721]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x57D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>待っておったぞ　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白リュウさまの神殿を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のイト姫が　つきとめたのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>We&apos;ve been waiting for you, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Itohime of the Cult of Daimon found the location of the White Dragon&apos;s temple.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3722]=[.I3722]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
      <draw:frame table:end-cell-address="script_dialogue.K3724" table:end-x="0.1839in" table:end-y="1.5602in" draw:z-index="1" draw:name="Immagine 2" draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P1" svg:width="3.115in" svg:height="35.1398in" svg:x="0.0791in" svg:y="-32.9535in">
