     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x57D_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いそがれよ　火の勇者たち！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白リュウさまを　お救いするのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You must hurry, Fire Heroes!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3723]=[.I3723]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro29">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x610_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジュカイは　神獣たちの　道じゃ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かれらは　ジュカイを　ぬけ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">それぞれの地に　戻るのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Sea of Trees is a mystical forest that leads to the dwellings of every divine beast.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: this is the only hint that you can walk on certain spots in the Sea of Trees to warp to each divine beast shrine. Walk in those trees between the mountains and you&apos;ll warp to the red boulders where the beasts are sealed.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3724]=[.I3724]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x668_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教のイト姫の　あやつるクモどもに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白リュウさまも　封印されて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">しまうやもしれん</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Itohime&apos;s army of spiders is attempting to seal the sacred White Dragon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3725]=[.I3725]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x668_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>はやく　富士の神殿に行くのじゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いそがれよ　火の勇者たち！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Fire Heroes! You must hurry to the temples of Fuji!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3726]=[.I3726]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x6F7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大神主の　オズノさまが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神社の　なかで　お待ちじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria! Chief Priest Ozuno-sama is expecting you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3727]=[.I3727]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro18">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4309-0x739_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おまえが　富士山へ　向かった後<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オズノさまは　リュウとなり</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">天に　のぼられた</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>After you left for Mount Fuji, Ozuno-sama became a dragon and ascended to the heavens.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the yukkuri playthrough remarked this fact. I think Ozuno himself was the White Dragon, which is the reason the Church of Daimon couldn&apos;t seal it: because it wasn&apos;t in its temple yet. Once you start making your way, Ozuno turns into a dragon, flies up, and probably flies down Fuji&apos;s crater to land in his temple. Of course, this is the only hint you get about this plot point, lol</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3728]=[.I3728]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x4325</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0xAB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>神社</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F405])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Shrine" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Shrine</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F405]); COLUMN([.F405]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F405" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F405</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x102_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おまえたち　火の一族の　勇者にしか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">すでに　この　ジパングは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">すくえぬじゃろう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only you, the heroes of the Fire Clan, can save Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3731]=[.I3731]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x150_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おまえの　おこないを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きろく　するかえ？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Would you like me to keep a record of your deeds?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3732]=[.I3732]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x17D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>きろく　するぞえ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">がんばりなされ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>So it shall be done.\n</text:p><text:p>Good luck.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3733]=[.I3733]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x19E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>がんばるのじゃぞ</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Good luck.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3734]=[.I3734]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x1B2_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふぁふぁふぁ　わしが　３００年も<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">生きておる　大神主の　オズノ　じゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よく　来たのう　ジライア！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hoh hoh hoh! I am Chief Priest Ozuno, who has lived for 300 years! Well met, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3735]=[.I3735]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x1B2_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神々の　神聖な　神殿が<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　けがされたのじゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あそこには　わしらも　入れんのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Cult of Daimon is defiling the temple of the Gods! Alas, we cannot tread those sacred grounds!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3736]=[.I3736]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x1B2_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神々が　しゅくふくした　火の一族の<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">勇者なら　神殿に　入れる！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たすけて　くれぬか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Only the heroes of the Fire Clan, blessed by the Gods, may do so!\n</text:p><text:p>Will you help us?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3737]=[.I3737]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x2E0_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>うむ！　さすが　火の一族の　勇者！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">神殿は　富士山の　地下じゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行ってくれ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Well said, hero of the Fire Clan!\n</text:p><text:p>The temple is under Mount Fuji.\n</text:p><text:p>I will pray for your fortune!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3738]=[.I3738]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x33B_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>オズノの　依頼を　引き受けた</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You have accepted Ozuno&apos;s request.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3739]=[.I3739]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4325-0x362_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それは　こまった！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">このままでは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングが　ほろびてしまう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ah, that is a terrible shame...\n</text:p><text:p>Then Jipang is doomed.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3740]=[.I3740]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x4341</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4341-0x6C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>火口は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士山の奥へと　続いている</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">中へ　入って　行けそうだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The crater leads deep inside Mount Fuji. You should be able to enter from here.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3742]=[.I3742]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4341-0xAA_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>富士山</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mount Fuji</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3743]=[.I3743]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro11">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4341-0xE6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアは　空に向かって　叫んだ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ようし！　江戸へ　行くぞ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria yelled towards the sky:\n</text:p><text:p>\n</text:p><text:p>Edo, here I come!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3744]=[.I3744]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4341-0xE6_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>やまびこが　かえって来た<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">[color]&lt;$00&gt;いけ〜　いけ〜</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>A voice echoed back:\n</text:p><text:p>\n</text:p><text:p>[color]&lt;$00&gt;Go! Go!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3745]=[.I3745]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
