     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オー！　フレンド　ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひさしぶりネ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ワタシよ！　ホテイ丸ネ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh, friend! Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>Long time! It is me! Hoteimaru!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>CHECK, Hoteimaru&apos;s accent</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3878]=[.I3878]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0xEB_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いま　スゴイこと　考えてます<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教　やっつける</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">カラクリの　兵隊さん　デス！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Come up with great idea!\n</text:p><text:p>Mechanic soldier to fight Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3879]=[.I3879]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
