    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro13">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0x2EF_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おわん出せ〜　おわん出せ〜<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おわんだせ〜の　おはしにぃー</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh when the sink! Oh when the sink!\n</text:p><text:p>Oh when the sink got matching inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the joke here is that the kids are starting to talk with a weird foreign accent like Hoteimaru</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3884]=[.I3884]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0x2EF_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>このサング　ホテイ丸さんに　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">教えて　もらったデース！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>This song, learned from Hoteimaru!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3885]=[.I3885]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0x360_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ウチの　にいちゃんは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">発音が　わるい　デース！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ミーが　ちゃんと　歌いマース！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Brother pronounce bad! I sing better!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3886]=[.I3886]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0x360_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ｏｈ　Ｗｈｅｎ　Ｔｈｅ　Ｓａｉｎｔ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">Ｏｈ　Ｗｈｅｎ　Ｔｈｅ　Ｓａｉｎｔ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">Ｇｏ　Ｍａｒｃｈｉｎｇ　Ｉｎ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh when the saints! Oh when the saints!\n</text:p><text:p>Oh when the saints go marching in!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3887]=[.I3887]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro50">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x458D-0x413_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>フレンド　ホテイ丸に　お返しに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングの　歌　おしえたデース！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ふーじーは　ひろいーな　おっきーな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I teach friend Hoteimaru song too!\n</text:p><text:p>Mooount Fuuuji iiis the hiiigheeest mountain ooof Jipaaang! </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: in the original line, the kid is singing a song called &quot;Umi&quot; (the sea), but it&apos;s replacing Umi with Fuji. Since I doubt anyone in the west can appreciate this difference, I let him quote a different song that is actually centered on Mount Fuji. Incidentally, if you want to let him say that in Japanese, it would be &quot;Fuji wa nippon&apos;ichi no yama&quot; (swap Nippon for Jipangu for make it more game-lore-accurate)</text:p><text:p>This is the part I&apos;m using, if you&apos;re curious: https://youtu.be/za1d5eaEPzE?t=40</text:p><text:p>This is the original song the game is quoting, but swapping &quot;umi&quot; for &quot;fuji&quot;: https://youtu.be/WQUPzcB1xT0?t=8</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F3888]=[.I3888]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
