     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>湖の橋を　渡ったところの　石は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白タカさま　なのじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんな　おすがたに・・・　シクシク</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Cross the lake&apos;s bridge and you&apos;ll find an ominous boulder. That used to be our sacred White Hawk...Sob, sob...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
