      <text:p>map-0x4881-0x74_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>まいど　おいでやす！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　信用第一の　南蛮屋だす！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんぞ　ご用でっか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome, welcome! If you&apos;re looking for high-quality exotic goods from overseas, look no further! What&apos;ll it be?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4130]=[.I4130]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
