     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4881-0xC1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お客さんやから　案内してますのや<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんまり　知らん人に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">店のこと　話さんといてや！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Since you&apos;re a paying customer, let me just mention -- don&apos;t go telling strangers too much about our shop!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>CHECK</text:p><text:p>NOTE: this is what he says when you leave the menu after making a purchase. if you don&apos;t buy anything, you just get the &quot;come back anytime&quot; message.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4131]=[.I4131]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
