     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おいでやす！　ここでしか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">手に　入らん　世界の一流品が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">店んなか　ぎょうさん　ありまっせ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We have many unique goods from all over the world! You won&apos;t find these anywhere else in Jipang!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
