      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x489D-0x2EB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この教会の　中の　人のほとんどは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水害で　田畑を　失った　人たちです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>These poor souls have lost their fields to a terrible flood.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4144]=[.I4144]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
