     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4142])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Please, come on in. Let us pray together." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Please, come on in. Let us pray together.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4142]); COLUMN([.F4142]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4142" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4142</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x5C4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>なんだ！　お金もっていないじゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ないですか！　かえってください</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">教会には　いれられない！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4143])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="What?! You don&apos;t have enough money?!\n&#x0a;Leave at once! This church isn&apos;t for you!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>What?! You don&apos;t have enough money?!\n</text:p><text:p>Leave at once! This church isn&apos;t for you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTE: near-dupe of F4143</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4189]=[.I4189]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x61F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>南蛮屋さんが　たててくださる　家は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ずいぶん　遠い土地らしいんですが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そんなことは　気にしてませんよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The new houses we&apos;re getting from the overseas merchant are far away from here, but I don&apos;t mind much.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4190]=[.I4190]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x61F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>一日も　早く　ウチにも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">家の　割り当てが　回って　来ないかと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いなくなる人を　見るたび　思うんです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Every time I see someone leave, I keep hoping I&apos;ll be the next lucky fellow!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4191]=[.I4191]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x6E4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いのっていると　たのしいの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">イヤな　ことが　みんな</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">消えて　いくような　気がするの</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I like praying. It feels like all the bad things are fading away.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4192]=[.I4192]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x736_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もう一つの　教会にも　私たちと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">同じように　大門教に　救いを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">求めている人たちが　いるのです！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The other church is also filled with those who have been saved by the Cult of Daimon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4193]=[.I4193]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x736_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さあ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あなたたちも　いっしょに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いのりましょう！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come, let us pray together!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4194]=[.I4194]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x7C5_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おや！　ジライアはん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わてが　南蛮屋だす</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデは　めんこいのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>&apos;Ey, Ziria! Just your local Merchant here. Izzat darling Tsunade?\n</text:p><text:p>Cute as a button, ain&apos;t she!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: I should mention that Gouyokku has an Osaka-ben accent. His dialogue could use some extra pizzazz.</text:p><text:p>Supper: well, you asked for it!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4195]=[.I4195]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x7C5_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうだ　ジライアはん！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">その　ツナデ　１０００両で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">売りまへんか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>How &apos;bout it, Ziria?\n</text:p><text:p>What say ya sells her to me for <text:span text:style-name="T2">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">1,000?</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4196]=[.I4196]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x868_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ほれ　見てみい　ツナデ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアも　欲ボケじゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">友情も　なにも　あらへんで</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoo! Ya hearin&apos; this, Tsunade?\n</text:p><text:p>Ziria&apos;d sell his friends for easy dough! He might be greedier than me!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4197]=[.I4197]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x868_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さあ！　やりましょ　ジライアはん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わてが　大門教１３人衆の　８番手</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゴーヨックだす！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Now get ready, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;m the eighth of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists, Gouyokku!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4198]=[.I4198]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x924_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そんな　ムチャ　やがな・・・<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よろしい　ほな　１００万両や</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデを　売ってくれはりまっか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ya drives a hard bargain, pal...\n</text:p><text:p>All right! I&apos;ll give ya <text:span text:style-name="T2">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">1,000,000 for &apos;er!</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4199]=[.I4199]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x996_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いや　たいした　友情だすな！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ごりっぱや！　しかたないな</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教１３人衆の　８番手</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>What a beauuuutiful friendship! Brings a tear to my eye.\n</text:p><text:p>Allow me to introduce myself...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4200]=[.I4200]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4929-0x996_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　ゴーヨックが　ぼちぼち<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あいてに　なりまひょ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わて　ほんまに　つおいで！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m the eighth of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists, Gouyokku!\n</text:p><text:p>Lemme warn ya...I&apos;m pretty strong!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4201]=[.I4201]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x4945</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4945-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>寺</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F2698])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Temple" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Temple</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F2698]); COLUMN([.F2698]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F2698" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F2698</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4945-0x49_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教に入れば　不老不死に　なるから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はかなど　いらぬと　いって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">境内に　大門教会を　たておった！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Those Daimonists claimed there wouldn&apos;t be any need for cemeteries once they achieve eternal life...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4204]=[.I4204]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4945-0x49_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひどい　はなしじゃ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">それなのに　みな　だまされおって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　入会してしまった！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That&apos;s how they convinced the villagers to convert and let them build their churches on our holy ground!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4205]=[.I4205]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4945-0x49_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>だれか　この村を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">救って　くれない　ものか！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ナンマイダ　ナンマイダ・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Can Shuzenji be saved before the end? May the Gods have mercy...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4206]=[.I4206]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4945-0x152_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>勇者の人たちが　村を　すくって<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">くれたんだ！　ありがたい　ことだ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ナンマイダ　ナンマイダ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4104])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="You are the heroes who saved the village! Thank you so much!\n&#x0a;Praise the Gods for sending you!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You are the heroes who saved the village! Thank you so much!\n</text:p><text:p>Praise the Gods for sending you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4104]); COLUMN([.F4104]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4104" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4104</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x4961</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0xB2_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>関所のサクは　かたく<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">閉ざされている</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The gate is sealed shut.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4209]=[.I4209]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0xDA_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>なにもありませんでした</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F8])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="You find nothing." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You find nothing.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F8]); COLUMN([.F8]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F8" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F8</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0xF4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>箱根の関</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hakone Barrier</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4211]=[.I4211]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x1E7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれは　南蛮屋から<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なにも　もらっておらんぞ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツマラン　いいがかりを　つけるな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Say whaaat? The merchant bribed me? No way! I&apos;d never accept a bribe! I mean, whaaat?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4212]=[.I4212]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x239_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　箱根の関は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教以外は　通さん！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かえれ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The Hakone barrier is closed!\n</text:p><text:p>Only loyal Daimonists may pass!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4213]=[.I4213]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x26D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ちぇっ！　いつから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">通れなく　なっちまったんだ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まったくよ！　ふざけんな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>What do you mean, it&apos;s closed?!\n</text:p><text:p>You gotta be kidding me!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4214]=[.I4214]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x2B9_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ありがとうございます<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これで　さがみに帰れます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thank you. I can finally go back to Sagami.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4215]=[.I4215]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x2E8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さがみの国の　あたみ温泉に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行きたいんじゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">俳句の会が　あるんじゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I need to go to Atami Hot Spring in Sagami! I miss the haiku club!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4216]=[.I4216]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x330_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ありがとうございます<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あたみ温泉に　行くことがありましたら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぜひ　俳句の会を　のぞいてくだされ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thank you. If you ever go to Atami Hot Spring, you should pay a visit to the haiku club!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4217]=[.I4217]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x38E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>関所の　向こうの　さがみ国じゃあ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教が　大はやりずら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">世も末ずら！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The lands of Sagami are just beyond the barrier. It seems the Cult of Daimon is very popular there...How dreadful.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4218]=[.I4218]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro19">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x3D6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>橋を渡って　北へ行けば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">白タカさまの　三島村！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">南へ行けば　しゅぜん寺村よ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>If you cross the bridge west from here and head north, you&apos;ll find Mishima Village, where the sacred White Hawk lives!</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>Go south from the bridge and you&apos;ll find Shuzenji Village.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4219]=[.I4219]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x420_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　さがみ国には<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「アシモト　五兄弟」っていう</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とんでもない　やつらが　いてよお</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>A word of warning...During your travels in Sagami, you&apos;re going to come across the Ashimoto Quintuplets.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4220]=[.I4220]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro13">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x420_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>旅人に　おそれられてんだよお<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたも　せいぜい　気をつけなよ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">すぐ　人の足元　見てくるからよお！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>They&apos;re a nightmare for all travelers!\n</text:p><text:p>Don&apos;t let them take advantage of you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: &quot;ashimoto o miru&quot; means &quot;take advantage&quot;. It gets lost in translation, but it&apos;s a play on their name.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4221]=[.I4221]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x4961-0x4D5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この関所から　ひんがしに　行きゃあ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングで　一番　でっけえ温泉町</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あたみ温泉が　ありますけん！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Go east from here and you&apos;ll find Atami Hot Spring, the biggest hot spring town in Jipang!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4222]=[.I4222]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x497D</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>宿屋</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F111])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Inn" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Inn</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F111]); COLUMN([.F111]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F111" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F111</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x7F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>理想郷を　つくるとかいいながら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">結局　大門教にのみ　つごうのいい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">世界になるんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Cult of Daimon keeps talking about making a perfect world, but you can bet it&apos;s only going to be perfect for them.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4225]=[.I4225]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0xCF_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>南蛮屋の　借金の取り立てが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きびしくって　夜逃げして来ました</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんとかしてください　ジライアさん</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I had to skip town before that overseas merchant came to collect his debt, {or else.} Please, do something about him!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4226]=[.I4226]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x12F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ありがとうございます<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これで　しゅぜん寺に　帰れます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thank you. I can finally go back to Shuzenji Village.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4227]=[.I4227]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x164_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切の里の者です！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まだ　大門教は　マサカドの復活に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">てまどって　いるようです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m from Kumogiri Hamlet!\n</text:p><text:p>It seems the Cult of Daimon is having some trouble reviving Masakado.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4228]=[.I4228]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x164_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そのため　火の勇者の　ジライアさんが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">江戸に　着けないように</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">時間かせぎを　しているようです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That&apos;s why they&apos;re trying to delay your arrival in Edo as much as possible.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4229]=[.I4229]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x164_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>箱根の関を　止めたのも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どうやら　そのためのようです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Closing the Hakone barrier must have been one of their attempts to buy time.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4230]=[.I4230]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x164_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この先も　まだ　大門教のワナが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">待ち受けていると　思います</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お気をつけて！　ジライアさん！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;m sure they&apos;ve set many other traps along the way. Stay sharp, Ziria-san!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4231]=[.I4231]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x2BA_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F117</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x2BA_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひと晩　６５両でございますが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりになりますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4106])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s 両65 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s 両65 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4106]); COLUMN([.F4106]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4106" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4106</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x320_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F117</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x320_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひと晩　６５両でございますが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりになりますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4106])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s 両65 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s 両65 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4106]); COLUMN([.F4106]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4106" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4106</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x386_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お客さま！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お金が　あるときに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　おこしください！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F121])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Good sir!\n&#x0a;Please come back when you have enough money!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Good sir!\n</text:p><text:p>Please come back when you have enough money!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F121]); COLUMN([.F121]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F121" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F121</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x497D-0x3BC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それでは　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ごゆっくり　お休みください</text:span></text:p>
