     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>盗人保険に入らねェか？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">保険に入りゃ重傷を負ったとき</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">救助隊が迎えにいくぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Would you like to buy a Thief Insurance?\n</text:p><text:p>If you have our insurance, we&apos;ll send a rescue team if you get hurt badly.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
