     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>気が付きなさったか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よかった、よかった</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また、旅に出なさるのけえ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You&apos;ve made the right choice.\n</text:p><text:p>Good luck in your travels.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
