     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x339_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お金を　いただかないと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">村には　入れられない</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">決まりなんです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;m sorry, but you can&apos;t enter the village without paying the entry fee.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTE: this message doesn&apos;t seem to be used. they probably intended for this to be the response if you say &quot;no&quot;, but that just uses the below text, which is what&apos;s shown if you say &quot;yes&quot; when you don&apos;t have enough money.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4470]=[.I4470]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x37A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お金が　ないんですね<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こんどは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お金を　持って来てくださいね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ah, it seems you don&apos;t have the money. Don&apos;t worry, I&apos;ll wait.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4471]=[.I4471]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x3BB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お待ちして　おりました<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">弟から　ウワサは　きいて　おりますよ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさん　ですな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ah, you must be Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>My little brother told me about you.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4472]=[.I4472]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x3BB_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれは　大門教の　ヤシャ姫さまに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">９９９両　もらったんで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここを　動くわけには　いきません</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Yashahime-sama is paying me <text:span text:style-name="T2">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">999 to stand on this spot and prevent you from going through.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4473]=[.I4473]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x3BB_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>でも　それ以上のお金を　もらえるなら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おれにも　せいぎの心が　ありますから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">通して　さしあげましょう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Buuut...I&apos;ll move out of the way if you offer me a better deal.\n</text:p><text:p>I do believe in justice, after all!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4474]=[.I4474]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x3BB_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>１０００両払って　いただけますか？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Are you willing to pay me <text:span text:style-name="T17">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">1,000?</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4475]=[.I4475]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x4F8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お待ちして　おりました<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">弟から　ウワサは　きいて　おりますよ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさん　ですな！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4472])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Ah, you must be Ziria-san!\n&#x0a;My little brother told me about you." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ah, you must be Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>My little brother told me about you.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4472]); COLUMN([.F4472]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4472" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4472</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x4F8_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれは　大門教の　ヤシャ姫さまに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">９９９両　もらったんで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここを　動くわけには　いきません</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4473])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Yashahime-sama is paying me 両999 to stand on this spot and prevent you from going through." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Yashahime-sama is paying me 両999 to stand on this spot and prevent you from going through.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4473]); COLUMN([.F4473]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4473" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4473</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x4F8_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>でも　それ以上のお金を　もらえるなら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おれにも　せいぎの心が　ありますから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">通して　さしあげましょう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4474])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Buuut...I&apos;ll move out of the way if you offer me a better deal.\n&#x0a;I do believe in justice, after all!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Buuut...I&apos;ll move out of the way if you offer me a better deal.\n</text:p><text:p>I do believe in justice, after all!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4474]); COLUMN([.F4474]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4474" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4474</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x4F8_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>１０００両払って　いただけますか？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4475])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Are you willing to pay me 両1,000?" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Are you willing to pay me 両1,000?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4475]); COLUMN([.F4475]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4475" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4475</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro39">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x635_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>すみませんねえ　大将！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たしかに　１０００両　いただきました</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあ　お通りください！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>...998, 999, 1,000. That&apos;s <text:span text:style-name="T2">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">1,000, all right! Thanks, love. You may pass!</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: the Ashimoto brothers call you <text:span text:style-name="T2">大将</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, &quot;chief&quot;, but I feel like they&apos;d call you &quot;love&quot;.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4480]=[.I4480]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x635_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おだわらの　兄たちの　ことも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひとつ　よろしく</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おねがい　いたします</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Say {hi} to my brothers in Odawara for me!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4481]=[.I4481]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x6D3_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おだわらの　兄たちの　ことも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひとつ　よろしく</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おねがい　いたします</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4481])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Say {hi} to my brothers in Odawara for me!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Say {hi} to my brothers in Odawara for me!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4481]); COLUMN([.F4481]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4481" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4481</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x71C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それじゃ　ここは　動けないなあ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でも　ホテイ丸って　人が・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤシャ姫さまは　気短かだから・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Then I won&apos;t be going anywhere.\n</text:p><text:p>Poor Hoteimaru...I hear Yashahime-sama has a very short temper...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4483]=[.I4483]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x71C_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん　助けてデース　とか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いってたのになあ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かわいそう　だったなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I can still hear his voice.\n</text:p><text:p>{Oh, friend! Ziria-san! Help!}\n</text:p><text:p>What a shame, what a shame...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4484]=[.I4484]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x7CC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お金が　ないんですか？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でも　ホテイ丸って　人が・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤシャ姫さまは　気みじかだから・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Awww, you don&apos;t have the money?\n</text:p><text:p>Poor Hoteimaru...I hear Yashahime-sama has a very short temper...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4485]=[.I4485]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x7CC_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん　助けてデース　とか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いってたのになあ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かわいそう　だったなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4484])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="I can still hear his voice.\n&#x0a;{Oh, friend! Ziria-san! Help!}\n&#x0a;What a shame, what a shame..." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I can still hear his voice.\n</text:p><text:p>{Oh, friend! Ziria-san! Help!}\n</text:p><text:p>What a shame, what a shame...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4484]); COLUMN([.F4484]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4484" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4484</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x874_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この村には　あの　悪名高い<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「アシモト　五兄弟」の　ふたりが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いるのよ　やーねぇ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Two of the infamous Ashimoto Quintuplets are in the village!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4487]=[.I4487]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x8C8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この村を　出て　南へ　行くと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大きな　大門教会の　ある</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おだわらの町だぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Go south from our village and you&apos;ll reach Odawara Town and its huge Daimon church.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4488]=[.I4488]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x8C8_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>でも　あそこは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教徒　ばっかりだからな</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">行く　気は　しねえよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>As you can imagine, there&apos;s plenty of Daimonists there.\n</text:p><text:p>I wouldn&apos;t go if I were you.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4489]=[.I4489]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x94F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おじいさんたちの　俳句の会が<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">開かれている　温泉宿が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あるんですよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The old men of the village opened their own haiku club at one of the inns!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4490]=[.I4490]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x94F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここも　いつ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　おそわれるか</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わからないから</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We don&apos;t know when the Cult of Daimon is going to attack us...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4491]=[.I4491]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0x94F_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みんな　こわいの　通り越して<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひらきなおっちゃって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そりゃ　もう　すごい歌　ばかりよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>So they&apos;ve opted to exorcise fear by writing poetry! </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4492]=[.I4492]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xA19_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ボクの　人生には<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いろんなことが　あったなあ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でも　いちども　あきらめなかったよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;ve faced many hardships during my life. Remember, boy: you must never succumb to sorrow.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the joke here is that this is a very young kid, but he talks like he&apos;s had a life&apos;s worth of experience on his shoulders.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4493]=[.I4493]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xA19_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いつも　前だけを　向いて<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ひとり　歩いてきたさ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">にいちゃんにも　いつか　わかるよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hold your head high, your eyes on the future. One day, you will understand.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4494]=[.I4494]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xABA_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>村の外には　モウリョウと　いう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">怪物が　たくさん　いるぞ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたも　気をつけなされ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>There are monstrous creatures known as Mouryou outside. Be careful in your travels!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4495]=[.I4495]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xB0E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この先の　おだわらと　かまくらは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">町ぐるみ　大門教なんだよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The towns of Odawara and Kamakura are teeming with Daimonists!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4496]=[.I4496]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xB0E_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん　今までの　ところとは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わけが　ちがうから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">じゅぶん　用心してくださいよ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>It&apos;s worse than anything you&apos;ve seen before, Ziria-san. Be cautious!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4497]=[.I4497]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xBA5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>このままでは　さがみの国は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　完全に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">支配されてしまいます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sagami is under almost complete Daimonist control...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4498]=[.I4498]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xBA5_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どうか　この　さがみの国を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の手から　お救いください</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-san! Please, save our country!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4499]=[.I4499]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xC33_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホテイ丸さんを　助けて！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-san! Please, save Hoteimaru-san!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4500]=[.I4500]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xC33_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おだわらの　ヤシャ姫が<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホテイ丸さんを　連れてったの！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">早くしないと　殺されちゃう！！！！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>He was captured by Yashahime of Odawara! His life is in danger!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4501]=[.I4501]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x526F-0xCBC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ありがとうございます　ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でも　大門教で　苦しんでいるのは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここばかりでは　ありませんよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Thank you so much, Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>But many others are still suffering because of the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4502]=[.I4502]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x528B</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x41_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>[color]&lt;$01&gt;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>湯船には　温泉の湯が　あった<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">その湯を　浴びると　体に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">力が　わき上がってきた</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F970])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="The pool is filled with hot spring water.\n&#x0a;You feel reinvigorated as soon as you enter." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The pool is filled with hot spring water.\n</text:p><text:p>You feel reinvigorated as soon as you enter.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F970]); COLUMN([.F970]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F970" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F970</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x91_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>温泉宿</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F971])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Hot Spring Inn" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hot Spring Inn</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F971]); COLUMN([.F971]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F971" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F971</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro29">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x127_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしらは　大門教の　マの手を　逃れ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">せめて　余生は　平和に　くらしたいと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ねがう　かよわき　じじいたちじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We are feeble old men who want nothing more than to spend the last years of their lives in peace and quiet.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I will do my best to write haiku that are structurally correct (5-7-5 syllables), but they&apos;re not going to be masterpieces. Which is probably fine, since they&apos;re just old men having fun writing haiku.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4506]=[.I4506]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x127_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>だから　ここでは　俗な世間の　ことは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">忘れて　風流に　俳句の会で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">楽しんで　いるのですじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That is the reason we escape from the worries of society by writing elegant verses.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4507]=[.I4507]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro47">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x127_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">村の　はんえいを　ねがう　うたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「まつしまや・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Here is my haiku, a wish for a prosperous future for our village.\n</text:p><text:p>{Ah, Matsushima...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: this is a play on a haiku credited to Basho, though it&apos;s not actually his. The original one is:</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「松島や ああ松島や 松島や」</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">Something along the lines of:</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">&quot;Matsushima, ah Matsushina, Matsushima&quot;</text:span></text:p><text:p/><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">This one however instead of repeating Matsushima, mentions two other places. It doesn&apos;t make much sense, but I guess that&apos;s the point.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4508]=[.I4508]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro52">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x127_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>　ああ　たかしまや　ながさきや」<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　一茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Beautiful Takashima,\n</text:p><text:p>and Nagasaki.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Issa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: I think this <text:span text:style-name="T13">一茶 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">is a reference to Issa Kobayashi (</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">小林一茶</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">), known as one of the four greatest haiku masters of Japan. He&apos;d sign his haiku as simply </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">一茶 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">(Issa, or &quot;one cup of tea&quot;). Here they roll with it, and each one of them signs their haiku with the kanji for numbers 1 to 10. This&apos;ll probably be lost in translation since western players won&apos;t really associate the reading of a kanji to its meaning. Using English names that carry the number meaning would feel out of place. I guess &quot;lost in translation&quot; is something we need to accept.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4509]=[.I4509]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x271_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしらは　この宿で　ひらかれる<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">俳句の会が　今では　ただひとつの</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たのしみ　なのですじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>This haiku club is the only pleasure we have left.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4510]=[.I4510]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x271_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句　すべての　生けるものを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オーエンするうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「やせがえる・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Allow me to compose a few verses in support of all living creatures.\n</text:p><text:p>{Skinny little frog...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4511]=[.I4511]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro13">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x271_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>　まけるな　二茶　ここにあり」<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　二茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Don&apos;t be beaten, don&apos;t give up!\n</text:p><text:p>Nisa stands by you.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Nisa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: this one is basically a straight quote of the original Issa haiku, but it swaps &quot;Issa&quot; for Nisa.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4512]=[.I4512]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x356_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この宿に　いる　じじいたちは　みな<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">俳句を　深く　愛するものばかりじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この場に　いられるのが　幸せじゃのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Everyone here loves haiku. I&apos;m glad to be among like-minded people.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4513]=[.I4513]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x356_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この世の　平和を　待ち望んだ歌じゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「うぐいすや・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This haiku embodies my desire for peace in the world.\n</text:p><text:p>{Little nightingale...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4514]=[.I4514]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro31">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x356_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>　なくまでまとう　ホトトギス」<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　三茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>If the cuckoo will not sing,\n</text:p><text:p>wait till it does so.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Sansa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: this one is a mix-and-match of two different haiku. &quot;Uguisu ya&quot; is the beginning of a few Issa haiku about the nightingale, while the rest is a famous haiku credited to Ieyasu Tokugawa (a famous story about Nobunaga, Toyotomi and Tokugawa writing haiku about the same subject, &quot;what to do if a cuckoo won&apos;t sing&quot;).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4515]=[.I4515]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x445_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>俳句を　こよなく　愛する者でないと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしらの　よむ　俳句の　ワビサビは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">味わえない　じゃろうなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only a true haiku fanatic can fully appreciate our verses.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4516]=[.I4516]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro53">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x445_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">季節を感ずる　旅人を　よめるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「行くはるに・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Now, here is a haiku about a traveler noticing the change of seasons.\n</text:p><text:p>{Spring is leaving, too...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: I&apos;m not 100% sure, but this might be a play on one of Basho&apos;s famous haiku, <text:span text:style-name="T10">行く春や鳥啼き魚の目は涙</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">, though only the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12">行く春 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">seems to be shared.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4517]=[.I4517]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro19">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x445_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>　はるばる　来たぜ　はこだて」<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　四茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh my, would you look at that?\n</text:p><text:p>It is now summer.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Shisa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: it&apos;s likely I didn&apos;t understand the reference of the haiku in the game, so I made another one, rolling with the explanation about the changing of seasons.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4518]=[.I4518]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x52C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みなさんの　風流な　うたを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きいていると　身も　心も</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">洗われるような　気がしますなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>As I listen to these refined verses, I feel refreshed in body and mind!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4519]=[.I4519]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x52C_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">田子の浦を見た　感動をよめるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「たごのうらゆ・・・・ウム！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I will now compose a few verses inspired by my visit to the Tago-no-ura bay in Suruga.</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>{Tago-no-ura...} Hmm, let me think...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the first verse may be a reference to a poem by Yamabe no Akahito, &quot;Having crossed Tago Bay&quot;, though it&apos;s not in a haiku format.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4520]=[.I4520]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro12">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x52C_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「たごのうらゆ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　ウララ　ウララ　ウラウラで」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　五茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{Taga-no-ura,\n</text:p><text:p>Oolala, oolala,\n</text:p><text:p>oola-oolala.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Gosa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: as the following line makes apparent, this devolves into being the lyrics to Linda Yamamoto&apos;s &quot;Nerai uchi&quot;, a hit song from 1973 (you may recognize it as one of the songs featured in the first Ouendan game). It doesn&apos;t even follow the haiku format in Japanese, honestly.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4521]=[.I4521]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro29">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x52C_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この後の　「この世は　わたしの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ためにある　ウッ！」を　あえて切る！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これを　切るまでに　十年かかった！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I had to cut the next part, {This whole world has been created entirely for me.}\n</text:p><text:p>You guys aren&apos;t ready for that yet!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: I wrote that part in a way it somewhat fits the Nerai uchi lyrics &quot;Kono yo wa watashi no tame ni aru&quot;. Also I referenced Back to the Future in that final line (what Marty says at the end of his Johnny B. Goode performance).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4522]=[.I4522]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x687_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここまで　みごとな　句をよめる<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">人が　集まっていると　自分の存在が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いかに　小さいものか　わかりますなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>With so many people gathered here and reciting verses, you realize how small we are compared to the world.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4523]=[.I4523]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x687_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしも　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">老いへの　はげましを　よめるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「ふるいけや・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I feel inspired to write a few verses to encourage those who are getting on in years. {A very old pond...}</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4524]=[.I4524]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro54">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x687_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「ふるいけや<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　いけいけ　ひゅうま　ドンといけ」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　六茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{A very old pond.\n</text:p><text:p>There&apos;s a puma over there.\n</text:p><text:p>It leaves at full speed.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Rokusa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: this is a play on one of Basho&apos;s most famous poems:</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">古池や　蛙飛び込む　水の音</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">The old pond-</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">a frog jumps in,</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">sound of the water.</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">to be fair, only the &quot;ancient pond&quot; part is in common.</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">NOTE: for the sake of anyone outside our group who might be looking at this file (who ARE you?!), Zenki noticed while translating that the playthrough video he was watching had ピューマ instead of </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">ひゅうま here. after puzzling over that for a while, we eventually found out that this is because the video was taken on the PS3 release of the game, which edited this line for legal reasons (the original is referencing the opening theme to the old baseball anime Kyojin no Hoshi). but Zenki had already written a haiku based on &quot;puma&quot; and the reference is untranslatable anyway, so we just stuck with that.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4525]=[.I4525]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro45">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x687_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この句の　そこはかない　力強さに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">世の老人は　みな　涙するじゃろう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>These verses convey the hidden strength that we have in our old bones.\n</text:p><text:p>Very touching, if I do say so myself.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: from my understanding, the &quot;old pond&quot; was a metaphor for the mind of an old man (most likely the poet).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4526]=[.I4526]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x7C8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>俳句を　味わう　余裕を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もてずして　この世を　生きる者は</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ただ　あはれみしか　感じぬ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I pity those who live in this world without being able to appreciate a good haiku.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4527]=[.I4527]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro55">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x7C8_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">虫の　あはれさを　よめるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「やれ　うつな・・・ウム</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Speaking of which, let me compose a few verses about a pitiful fly...\n</text:p><text:p>{Wait, don&apos;t strike that fly...} Hmm...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: the first line is a reference to one of Issa&apos;s famous haiku, <text:span text:style-name="T2">やれ打つな蝿が手をすり足をする</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, &quot;Wait! Don&apos;t strike that fly! / he is wringing his hands there / and wringing his feet&quot;. </text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4528]=[.I4528]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro17">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x7C8_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「やれ　うつな<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　ハエハエカカカ　キンチョール」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　七茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{Wait, don&apos;t strike that fly.\n</text:p><text:p>Raid hunts bugs down like lizards,\n</text:p><text:p>and it kills them dead.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Shichisa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: then it devolves into an old ad for an insecticide called &quot;Kinchol&quot;. I&apos;ve decided to do something similar, and reference a classic Raid insecticide tag. I did swap &quot;Radar&quot; for &quot;lizards&quot; because radar technology might be too advanced for this world (ignore the fact that &quot;Raid&quot; wouldn&apos;t exist either)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4529]=[.I4529]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x7C8_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ううむ　あはれすぎる<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とくに　さいごの“ル”の　ひびきが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かなしい・・・かなしすぎたのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Yes, I believe this haiku conveys the sadness of their existence. When we see flies, we think only of killing them...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4530]=[.I4530]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x90B_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みなさん　だてに　お年は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">めされて　いないようじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">うたの　年輪を　感じますなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You can tell from our verses that our lives have been full of different experiences.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4531]=[.I4531]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro19">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x90B_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">富士の　バクハツを　しずめるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「富士やまに・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I will compose a few verses so powerful, they could contain the eruption of Mount Fuji itself.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: this is a reference to Taro Okamoto, who said that &quot;art is an explosion&quot;. I think it&apos;s been swapped with &quot;Fuji&quot; because Mount Fuji is a classic subject for haiku.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4532]=[.I4532]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro56">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x90B_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「富士やまに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　顔が　あっても　いいじゃないか」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　字余り　　　　　　　　　　　八茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{If our Mount Fuji\n</text:p><text:p>had a face in its crater,\n</text:p><text:p>would it be so bad?}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Hachisa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: Taro Okamoto once made a glass with a face at its bottom, while those around him told him not to. There&apos;s a famous commercial about this glass (that came free with a bottle of whiskey) where he says &quot;a face at the bottom of a glass isn&apos;t so bad, is it?&quot; (<text:span text:style-name="T2">グラスの底に顔があってもいいじゃないか</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">). Pretty obscure reference.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4533]=[.I4533]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0x90B_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>道を　キワめた者にしか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この句の　おくの　深さは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">見えぬ　じゃろう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only those who have mastered the art can perceive the true depth of my haiku.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4534]=[.I4534]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xA34_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みなさんの　うたは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">自分の　そうさく意欲を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">しげきするものが　ありますな</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>These verses answer our strong urge to create something beautiful.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4535]=[.I4535]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xA34_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしも　負けずに　一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">花の美しさを　たたえるうたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「ホウセンか・・・　美しい花じゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>On that subject, I&apos;m going to compose a haiku about the beauty of flowers.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4536]=[.I4536]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro18">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xA34_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「ホウセンか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　ソソソクラテスか　プラトンか」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　九茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{Daisies, oh daisies.\n</text:p><text:p>The most lovely of flowers.\n</text:p><text:p>Just don&apos;t push them up.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Kyuusa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: This is a reference to a Suntory Gold ad from 1976, featuring Nosaka Akiyuki (famous for the novel &quot;Grave of the Fireflies&quot;, which was later made into an animated movie by Studio Ghibli). Here&apos;s the ad in question: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SwzQkt56T6Y The joke is because &quot;Housenka&quot; ends with &quot;ka&quot;, like &quot;Socrates ka, Platon ka&quot;. Well, it&apos;s pretty untranslatable.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4537]=[.I4537]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xA34_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうじゃ　いんの　ふみかたに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やさしさが　見えかくれして</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">作者の心が　しのばれるじゃろう？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Beautiful and deep. I don&apos;t mean to brag, but this is a real masterpiece.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4538]=[.I4538]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xB7D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みなさん　なかなか　お上手で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">じゃが　まだまだ　上の句と　下の句の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つながりが　甘いようじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>My friends are pretty good, but they still haven&apos;t mastered the art.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4539]=[.I4539]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro57">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xB7D_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで　わしの一句<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">老いを　とらえた　キワミの　うたじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">「なつくさや・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Let me show you the fruits of years of training.\n</text:p><text:p>{Summer&apos;s verdant grass...}</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ZenkiTN: this is a reference to a famous Basho haiku, <text:span text:style-name="T2">夏草や兵どもが夢の跡</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, &quot;Summer grass; all the warriors are but the remains of dreams&quot;.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4540]=[.I4540]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro14">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xB7D_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「なつくさや<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　おじいちゃん　おくちくさ〜い！」</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　十茶</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>{Summer&apos;s verdant grass.\n</text:p><text:p>the wind released from my ass\n</text:p><text:p>could pulverize glass.}[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]-- Jussa</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the original text goes for &quot;grandpa, your breath stinks&quot;. I figured I&apos;d make them all rhyme instead (because a real poet rhymes, right?), and you know what rhymes with grass.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4541]=[.I4541]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xB7D_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　いんりつを　あみだすために<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしは　妻子を　すてた</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">むろん　後悔は　ない　ホッホッホ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I left my wife and children to write this haiku. I regret nothing. Hoh hoh hoh!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4542]=[.I4542]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x528B-0xCD0_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いや　いい湯　ですね<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あなたの　かつやくは　きいて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ますぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>These hot springs are the best.\n</text:p><text:p>Hey, I heard about your adventures.\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;re doing great!</text:p>
