     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さがみの国には　こわいものが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">三つある！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Do you know what the top three scariest things in Sagami are?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4560]=[.I4560]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0xD3_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>まずは　「アシモト　五兄弟」<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こいつらに　目を　つけられたら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もう　おしまいだ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Third place: the Ashimoto Quintuplets. Once they set their eyes on you, you&apos;re ruined!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4561]=[.I4561]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0xD3_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もっと　こわいのが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やっぱり　地震よ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こいつにゃ　逆立ちしても　勝てねぇ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Second place: the earthquakes.\n</text:p><text:p>The power of nature can be terrifying!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4562]=[.I4562]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0xD3_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そして　いちばん　こわいのが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のヤシャ姫よ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こいつは　こわい！！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>First place: Yashahime of the Cult of Daimon. She&apos;s definitely the scariest of them all!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4563]=[.I4563]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x1E2_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おだわらと　かまくらを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">支配しているのは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教１３人衆の　ヤシャ姫って　女だ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Odawara and Kamakura are under the rule of Yashahime, one of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4564]=[.I4564]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x1E2_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>モウリョウを　人に　とりつかせて<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">思いのままに　あやつるってんだから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">こいつは　こわい！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>She&apos;s a terrifying woman.\n</text:p><text:p>She&apos;ll use her Mouryou creatures to possess and manipulate you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4565]=[.I4565]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x2A4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F117</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x2A4_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひと晩　１０両でございますが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりになりますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F367])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s 両10 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s 両10 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F367]); COLUMN([.F367]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F367" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F367</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x30A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お客さま！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F2012])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to our inn, dear guest!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to our inn, dear guest!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F2012]); COLUMN([.F2012]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F2012" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F2012</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x30A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>お金が　あるときに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　おこしください！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F2013])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Feel free to come back when you wish to stay!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Feel free to come back when you wish to stay!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F2013]); COLUMN([.F2013]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F2013" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F2013</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x36C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それでは　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ごゆっくり　お休みください</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F122])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Please rest well." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Please rest well.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F122]); COLUMN([.F122]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F122" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F122</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x393_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>また　おこしください</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F123])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Please come again." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Please come again.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F123]); COLUMN([.F123]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F123" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F123</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x3A9_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いってらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お気をつけて　ジライアさま</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F124])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F124]); COLUMN([.F124]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F124" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F124</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x3E8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きろく　しますか？</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いえいえ　お金はいりません</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F125])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Good day! Would you like me to keep a record of your progress?\n&#x0a;No need to pay -- it&apos;s free!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Good day! Would you like me to keep a record of your progress?\n</text:p><text:p>No need to pay -- it&apos;s free!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F125]); COLUMN([.F125]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F125" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F125</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x42F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>それでは　きろく　します</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F126])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Let me write this down." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Let me write this down.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F126]); COLUMN([.F126]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F126" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F126</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x449_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>また　お気軽に　どうぞ！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F127])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Come back anytime!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come back anytime!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F127]); COLUMN([.F127]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F127" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F127</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x472_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　温泉やど！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">今どき　なんと　タダ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">泊らないとソン！！　泊まる？！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F972])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="This is a hot spring inn! It&apos;s completely free! You should stay for a while!\n&#x0a;How about it?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This is a hot spring inn! It&apos;s completely free! You should stay for a while!\n</text:p><text:p>How about it?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F972]); COLUMN([.F972]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F972" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F972</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x4C5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>また　おいで！！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F1620])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Come back!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come back!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F1620]); COLUMN([.F1620]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F1620" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F1620</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x52A7-0x4D7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ごゆっくり！！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F1621])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Rest well!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Rest well!</text:p>
