     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おだわら城の　トノさまも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤシャ姫の　あやつる　モウリョウに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とりつかれて　しまったらしいぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They say the lord of Odawara Castle has been possessed by one of Yashahime&apos;s Mouryou creatures.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
