     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>三つの玉　三人の火の勇者　そして<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">愛と　勇気と　根性がなければ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">マサカドは　封印できんぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>The three orbs! The three Fire Heroes! And love, courage, and determination!</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>Without those, Masakado cannot be sealed!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
