     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　おだわらの町だ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オレは　ヤシャ姫さまから　９９９９両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もらって　ここを　みはってるんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This is Odawara Town.\n</text:p><text:p>Yashahime-sama is paying me <text:span text:style-name="T2">両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">9,999 to guard this spot.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4612]=[.I4612]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5333-0x22A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>と　いっても<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おれは　大門教徒じゃない</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">話によっちゃ　考えないでも　ない</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Then again, I am no Daimonist.\n</text:p><text:p>There might be a way to change my mind...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4613]=[.I4613]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5333-0x22A_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアの大将なら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オレの　いってる　意味が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わかって　くれるはずだよねぇ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Do you catch my drift, love?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4614]=[.I4614]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5333-0x322_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　おだわらの町だ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オレは　ヤシャ姫さまから　９９９９両</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もらって　ここを　みはってるんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4612])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="This is Odawara Town.\n&#x0a;Yashahime-sama is paying me 両9,999 to guard this spot." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This is Odawara Town.\n</text:p><text:p>Yashahime-sama is paying me 両9,999 to guard this spot.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
