     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x53BF-0x16E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ヤシャ姫さまは　ここに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いらっしゃって　ないわ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ほんとうよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Yashahime-sama isn&apos;t here.\n</text:p><text:p>I swear.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
