     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジパングの　未来の姿を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">知りたいのなら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">占いオババの　ところへ　いきなされ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you&apos;re curious about the future of Jipang, try asking our fortune teller.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
