     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x549F-0x53_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここだけの　はなしじゃが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤシャ姫さまは　火の勇者の　ひとりを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここで　しとめると　いっておったぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Just between you and me...\n</text:p><text:p>Yashahime-sama declared that here, she will eliminate one of the Fire Heroes.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
