     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教のやつらが　いい男と　女の子<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">それと　ヘンな外人を　連れて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">東へ行くのを　見たぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I saw the Daimonists bring a girl, a handsome man, and a weird foreigner to the east.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4893]=[.I4893]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
