     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x22A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここの港から　大門教に　逆らった<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">バカどもを　毎日　獄門島へ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">送っているのよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Every day, a ship filled with fools who defied the Cult of Daimon leaves port, bound for Gokumon Island.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4977]=[.I4977]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x22A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あいつら　死ぬまで　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教のために　はたらくのよ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ザマアミロ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They&apos;ll be working for the Cult until they die! Hah, serves them right!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4978]=[.I4978]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x2B7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教で　一番　エライかたは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">江戸の　邪神斎さまだ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">名前ぐらい　おぼえておけ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The most important person in the Cult of Daimon is Jashinsai-sama, in Edo! Remember his name!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4979]=[.I4979]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x30B_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>獄門島を　支配する<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムテキオーさまは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　金庫番さね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mutekiou-sama is the real money-maker of the Cult of Daimon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4980]=[.I4980]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x30B_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>獄門島で　掘り出した黄金は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムテキオーさまの手で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">江戸に　送られているのさ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>He has gold extracted from Gokumon Island, and then he personally sends it to Edo.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4981]=[.I4981]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x393_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>えっ？　船？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">獄門島行きの船の　ことかい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">それなら　いま出たばっかりだよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>What? A ship? Oh, are you talking about the daily shipment to Gokumon Island?\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;m sorry, you just missed it!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4982]=[.I4982]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x3DE_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ムテキオーさまなら　教会に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いらっしゃってるわよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mutekiou-sama is at the church.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4983]=[.I4983]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x3DE_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>まじめな方だから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここに　いらしたときは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">必ず　お祈りを　かかさないの</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Whenever he comes to Kanagawa, he always prays at the church.\n</text:p><text:p>His faith is truly inspirational.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4984]=[.I4984]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x455_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>獄門島に　おくられたが　さいご<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">絶対に　生きては　出られんそうじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さすがは　ムテキオーさまじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Once you&apos;re sent to Gokumon Island, you never leave again.\n</text:p><text:p>Mutekiou-sama is very thorough!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4985]=[.I4985]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5723-0x4B7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうじゃ　りっぱな　港町じゃろ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　おかげで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">南蛮との　取り引きが　ふえたんじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Wonderful town, isn&apos;t it? It&apos;s all thanks to the Cult of Daimon for opening trade routes with foreign countries!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4986]=[.I4986]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x573F</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0x29_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>宿屋</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F111])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Inn" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Inn</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F111]); COLUMN([.F111]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F111" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F111</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0x57_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>獄門島は　黄金が　とれるってよ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">その黄金で　大門教は　軍隊を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">作るそうじゃ・・・　コワイねえ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;ve heard the Cult of Daimon uses the gold extracted from Gokumon Island to build its army...It&apos;s a scary thought.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F4989]=[.I4989]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0xCE_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F117</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0xCE_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひと晩　７５両でございますが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりになりますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4896])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s 両75 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s 両75 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4896]); COLUMN([.F4896]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4896" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4896</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0x134_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここは　宿屋でございます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F117])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome to the inn!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Welcome to the inn!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F117]); COLUMN([.F117]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F117" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F117</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x573F-0x134_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ひと晩　７５両でございますが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりになりますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4896])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s 両75 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s 両75 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4896]); COLUMN([.F4896]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4896" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4896</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
