     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5793-0x1C4_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>つけもの石には　デカすぎるし<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">船のイカリには　ぶかっこうだし</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさん　何か　ありませんか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s too big to use as a counterweight...\n</text:p><text:p>And the wrong shape to use as an anchor. Any ideas, Ziria-san?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
