     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>どうしても　行きたいと　いうなら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムテキオーさまに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">相談してみては　いかがじゃな？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If you want to go so badly, why don&apos;t you ask Mutekiou-sama about it?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5030]=[.I5030]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
