      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5ABF-0x358_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>「土偶ロボ」だヨ！　ちっちゃいが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">使うで　ビッグになる！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">三人乗りネ　でも　水に　よわいヨ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F5143])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It is {Doguu Robot}!\n&#x0a;Small, but get big when use!\n&#x0a;Three can ride! But weak to water!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It is {Doguu Robot}!\n</text:p><text:p>Small, but get big when use!\n</text:p><text:p>Three can ride! But weak to water!</text:p>
