     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5ABF-0x358_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ワタシ　カラクリ兵の　せっけい図を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぜんぶ　やぶります！　はやく</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">イッテ　ください！　フレンド！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I shred all clockwork soldier plans!\n</text:p><text:p>Now go, friend!</text:p>
