     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5CD3-0x60_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教が　くるり城に　男たちを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">連れて　行ったのは　工場で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はたらかせる　ためですよ　きっと！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Those Daimonists brought the men to Kururi Castle to work at their factory, no doubt about it!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5366]=[.I5366]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
