     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教打倒の日まで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">がんばってください</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F4868])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Never stop fighting the Cult of Daimon, Ziria-san." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Never stop fighting the Cult of Daimon, Ziria-san.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F4868]); COLUMN([.F4868]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F4868" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F4868</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x1C1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>マサカドの復活は　もうすぐです<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お急ぎください</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさん！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F5272])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Masakado&apos;s revival is imminent!\n&#x0a;Make haste, Ziria-san!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Masakado&apos;s revival is imminent!\n</text:p><text:p>Make haste, Ziria-san!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F5272]); COLUMN([.F5272]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F5272" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F5272</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x201_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　くるりの町じゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">男は　みんな　大門教に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とられて　しもうた！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Daimonists captured all of the men from our town!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5413]=[.I5413]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x201_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みんな　城の中で<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はたらかされとったよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They&apos;re forcing them to work inside the castle!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5414]=[.I5414]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x26A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>くるりの城は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教が　建てた　城じゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Kururi Castle was built by the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5415]=[.I5415]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x26A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>地下では　人殺しの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">道具を　こさえとるちゅう　ウワサじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>There&apos;s rumors that they&apos;re assembling tools of murder in its basement.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5416]=[.I5416]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x2CF_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>くるり城の　地下から<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">一日中　キカイの　音が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きこえるのじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>All day long, we can hear the sound of machinery coming from Kururi Castle&apos;s basement.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5417]=[.I5417]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x2CF_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>男たちは　休みなく<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はたらかされて　おるのじゃろう</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なんとか　してやりたいのう！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They&apos;re forcing the men to work without rest...You have to do something!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5418]=[.I5418]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x35C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>城の地下で　はたらかされている<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">男たちの　気持ちも</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">くんでください！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Do you understand the plight of our men, toiling inside the castle?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5419]=[.I5419]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x35C_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>自分の手で　作ったものが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">人殺しに　使われることが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わかっていて　作り続けているのです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They must keep working, knowing that the tools they create are used for evil!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5420]=[.I5420]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x3F9_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>城の地下で　作っとる<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">カラクリ兵は</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">江戸城へ　送っとるらしい</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The clockwork soldiers made in the castle&apos;s basement are being sent to Edo Castle.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5421]=[.I5421]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x43A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここから　むさし国へ　続いていた道は<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教によって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ふさがれて　しまいました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The way to the lands of Musashi has been closed off by the Cult of Daimon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5422]=[.I5422]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x43A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>江戸へ　ぬけるには<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここの　大門教を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">うちたおすしか　ありません！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>To reach Edo, you must first defeat the Daimonists in Chiba!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5423]=[.I5423]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x4CE_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>北の　成田村の　さきに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ヤブシラズ　という</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">深い森が　ありますじゃ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Keep going north, beyond Narita Village, and you&apos;ll find the Forbidden Forest.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5424]=[.I5424]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x510_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　くるりの城の　工場を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">治めているのは　大門教１３人衆の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水王丸という　やつなんです！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The man in charge of Kururi Castle&apos;s factory is Suioumaru, one of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5425]=[.I5425]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x510_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>なんでも　邪神斎とかいう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　総大将の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムスコの一人だ　そうです！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Did you know that he&apos;s one of the sons of Jashinsai, the leader of the Cult of Daimon?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5426]=[.I5426]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro13">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x5B3_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　くるりの城の　工場を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">治めていたのは　大門教１３人衆の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水王丸という　やつです！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The man in charge of Kururi Castle&apos;s factory was Suioumaru, one of the Thirteen Daimon Cultists.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTE: almost the same message as F5425, but in past tense (presumably used after you beat him)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5427]=[.I5427]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5D5F-0x5B3_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>なんでも　邪神斎とかいう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　総大将の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムスコの一人だ　そうです！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F5426])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Did you know that he&apos;s one of the sons of Jashinsai, the leader of the Cult of Daimon?" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Did you know that he&apos;s one of the sons of Jashinsai, the leader of the Cult of Daimon?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F5426]); COLUMN([.F5426]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F5426" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F5426</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
