     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教に　入会しないと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">地下で　こきつかわれる</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあ　あんたも　祈りなさい！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Either you join the Cult of Daimon, or you work to death in the basement...\n</text:p><text:p>Better start praying.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5460]=[.I5460]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5DEB-0x242_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さいだんは　神聖なる　ところ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">その　まわりで　ウロウロしては</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">バチが　あたりますぞ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The altar is sacred! Do not loiter in front of it or you&apos;ll get punished!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5461]=[.I5461]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
