     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>階段は普通のものですが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なぜ　こんなところに階段が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あるのでしょうか</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>It appears to be an ordinary staircase...but what is it doing here?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
