    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5E07-0x5E7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教に　入会しなかったから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここに　連れてこられて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">カラクリ兵を　作らされているんだよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>They sent me here to make clockwork soldiers after I refused to join the Cult of Daimon...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5477]=[.I5477]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5E07-0x5E7_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれは　いやだ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　ためになんか</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はたらきたくない！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m sick of this!\n</text:p><text:p>I don&apos;t want to work for them!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5478]=[.I5478]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x5E07-0x67E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんたも　大門教に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">連れて　来られたのかい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かわいそうになあ　もうだめだ・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Were you kidnapped by the Daimonists, too? I know how you feel...\n</text:p><text:p>I can&apos;t take this anymore...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5479]=[.I5479]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
