     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ほう！　前橋城を　こえたか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さすが　ジライアよ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この　幻王丸　感心したぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>So, you survived Maebashi Castle.\n</text:p><text:p>Well done, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>I must admit, I&apos;m impressed!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
