    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x612C-0xC7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>この　いわつきの町は　大門教と<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ショーグンさまの　軍隊が　戦った</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">激戦の地じゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The town of Iwatsuki was where the army of the Shogun clashed with the Cult of Daimon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5627]=[.I5627]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x612C-0xC7_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>せっしゃも　その　ひとりでござったが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教の　強さが　おそろしくなって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ここに　ずっと　かくれてござった！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I was there on the battlefield...But after witnessing their might, I hid myself here.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5628]=[.I5628]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x612C-0xC7_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わが軍は　大敗をきした！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ショーグンさまの　おん身が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">どうなったのか　心配で　ござる！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Our army was wiped out!\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;m worried about the Shogun...\n</text:p><text:p>I hope he&apos;s safe!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5629]=[.I5629]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0x6146 (small, not used?)</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x6146-0xA1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>奥宮</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Rear Shrine</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5631]=[.I5631]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x6146-0xD4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>布都の剣はこの神社の奥<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">宝物殿にまつられています</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この剣はヘビが守っているんです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Futsunomitama is stored in this shrine, guarded by a snake.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the Futsunomitama is a divine sword described in the &quot;Record of Ancient Matters&quot;. Not that it matters (the pun nobody will hear).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5632]=[.I5632]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x6146-0x124_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大変だ！布都の剣が盗まれた！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そのたたりじゃ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">茨城の鬼があばれだしたそうだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This is terrible! The Futsunomitama has been stolen! This is a curse!\n</text:p><text:p>The oni of Ibaraki are rampaging!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5633]=[.I5633]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
