    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x619C-0x55_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もう　どこにも　逃げ場は　ないわ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教は　ジパングの　すべてを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">支配して　しまうのよ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>There&apos;s nowhere left to run...\n</text:p><text:p>The Daimonists are going to conquer Jipang!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5655]=[.I5655]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x619C-0x55_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>マサカドが　復活してしまえば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">何もなくなって　しまうわ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　入るしか　ないの？！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Once Masakado is back, he&apos;ll destroy everything! Do we have no choice but to join the Cult of Daimon?!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5656]=[.I5656]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x619C-0x55_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あなたしか　いないのよ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おねがいします！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria-san! You&apos;re our only hope!\n</text:p><text:p>Please, save us!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5657]=[.I5657]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x619C-0x14C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさん　雲切の里の者です<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさんのために</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">秘密の　きろく所を　作っておきました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F5591])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Ziria-san, I&apos;m from Kumogiri Hamlet.\n&#x0a;I&apos;m here to record your progress in secret." calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria-san, I&apos;m from Kumogiri Hamlet.\n</text:p><text:p>I&apos;m here to record your progress in secret.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F5591]); COLUMN([.F5591]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F5591" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F5591</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x619C-0x14C_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もちろん　お金は　いりません<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きろく　しますか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F5592])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="It&apos;s free, of course.\n&#x0a;Should I write a record?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s free, of course.\n</text:p><text:p>Should I write a record?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F5592]); COLUMN([.F5592]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F5592" calcext:value-type="string">
