    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro12">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x6394-0x31C_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>前夜祭って　ぜんやさい　だよね<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">邪神斎って　じゃしんさい　だよね</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あしたは　マサカド　ふっかつ祭！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Is Masakado really coming back?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: the original line is some untranslatable topic about how Zenyasai (the current, ironic festival of the Eve of Masakado&apos;s return), Jashinsai, and &quot;Fukkatsusai&quot; (the festival celebrating Masakado&apos;s return) all have &quot;sai&quot; at the end. I just wrote something else instead.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5892]=[.I5892]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0x6394-0x37E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさんたちが　たたかう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">邪神斎って　大門教の</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おやぶん　なんだってね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You guys are gonna fight the big bad boss of the Cult of Daimon, right?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5893]=[.I5893]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
