     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>マサカドが復活するとき<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">魔物があつまり</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やみが　おおいつくすという</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If Masakado is revived, the demons of Hell will invade Jipang, and the world will be engulfed in darkness.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F5983]=[.I5983]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
