     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここは　つちうら城だ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">水戸の　コーモン様が　いらして</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この町は　平和に　なった</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>This is Tsuchiura Castle.\n</text:p><text:p>Thanks to Koumon-sama&apos;s presence, our town is peaceful.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
