    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0x68_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">１０両でございますが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おとまりですか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F694])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Welcome!\n&#x0a;It&apos;s 両10 for the night.\n&#x0a;Will you stay?" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Welcome!\n</text:p><text:p>It&apos;s 両10 for the night.\n</text:p><text:p>Will you stay?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F694]); COLUMN([.F694]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F694" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F694</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0xA6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それでは　<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ごゆっくり　どうぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F695])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Please rest well." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Please rest well.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F695]); COLUMN([.F695]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F695" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F695</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0xC5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>また　どうぞ</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F696])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="See you soon." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>See you soon.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F696]); COLUMN([.F696]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F696" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F696</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0xD3_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いってらっしゃいませ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お気をつけて　ジライアさま</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F124])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama." calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Take care of yourself, Ziria-sama.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F124]); COLUMN([.F124]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F124" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F124</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0x106_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ガマ仙人とこの　ジライアだろ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オレだよ・・　おさらばデンジさ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ちっちぇえとき　あそんだんだぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You&apos;re the kid raised by the Toad Hermit, right? It&apos;s me, Osaraba Denji.</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>I used to play with you when you were just a li&apos;l shrimp.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6030]=[.I6030]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0x106_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そうだ！　もし　旅で　困ったら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">全国チェーンの　盗人村に　行きな</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おめえのことは　知らせておくぜ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>If you&apos;re ever in trouble during your travels, visit one of the other thief villages. We&apos;ve got a nation-wide network.</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>I&apos;ll let them know about you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6031]=[.I6031]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0x1C5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>水戸の　地下から　つぎの国に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ぬけられるが・・・　大門教が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">支配しているんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You can reach the next country from Mito&apos;s underground, but it&apos;s already under Daimonist control.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6032]=[.I6032]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDA8F-0x1C5_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教さえいなくなれば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また北の国に行けるし</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">商売ができるんだがな・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If the Daimonists were gone, I could finally go north. They&apos;re ruining my business...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6033]=[.I6033]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
