     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDAAB-0x50_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふるい　伝説に　よると<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族の　勇者たちとは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ガマ　ヘビ　ナメクジ族のことよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>According to the old tales, the heroes of the Fire Clan descend from the Toad, Snake, and Slug clans.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6036]=[.I6036]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
