     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしが　剣の名人　ボクデンじゃ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">みごと　たおせれば　ものすごい</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">必殺剣を　おしえるが　かかってくるか？</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I am Bokuden, master fencer!\n</text:p><text:p>Defeat me, and I&apos;ll teach you my special technique! Are you ready?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6062]=[.I6062]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x157_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>うむ！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Good!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6063]=[.I6063]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x15F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>さて　あなたは勝ちましたか？</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Now then, can you beat me?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6064]=[.I6064]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x181_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ええい！こしぬけめ！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さっさと　かえれ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F260])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Tch! Coward!\n&#x0a;Get out of my sight!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Tch! Coward!\n</text:p><text:p>Get out of my sight!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F260]); COLUMN([.F260]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F260" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F260</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x1AC_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>うむ！　みごとじゃ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">１回目の　こうげきが　つよくなる</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">必殺剣　一の太刀を　さずける！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Well done! I will teach you my Hitotsu no tachi, which increases the strength of your first strike!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: &quot;Hitotsu no tachi&quot; was the name of a technique invented by Bokuden historically... Not that it matters now.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6066]=[.I6066]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x202_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ダメか　わしの　必殺剣を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おぼえて　くれる　ヤツは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おらぬかの　かなしい・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>No good! Will I ever find someone worthy of learning my special technique?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6067]=[.I6067]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB53-0x250_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしは　よい　デシを　もった</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあ　行くのじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F261])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="You are a worthy pupil, Ziria!\n&#x0a;Go forth, young hero!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You are a worthy pupil, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Go forth, young hero!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F261]); COLUMN([.F261]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F261" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F261</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0xDB6F</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x2D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>盗人村</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F2233])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Thief Village" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thief Village</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F2233]); COLUMN([.F2233]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F2233" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F2233</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0xF4_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ここが　盗人村ですよ　ジライアさん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つちうら城の　なかまから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">しらせが　入っています　ごゆっくり</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Welcome to the Thief Village, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Our comrade in Tsuchiura Castle told us about you. Make yourself at home!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6071]=[.I6071]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro8">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x156_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ガマ仙人さんとこの　人なんだってね<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教に　ジャマされて　困っているんだ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">忍術で　チョイチョイって　やっつけてよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You&apos;re the kid raised by the Toad Hermit, right?</text:p><text:p>#BOXPAUSE()</text:p><text:p>Those Daimonists are a real bother. Use your ninjutsu to deal with them, already.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6072]=[.I6072]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x1C8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>東に　行くと　かしま村だ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あそこの　神獣を　大門教が</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ねらっていたが　どうなったか</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Head east and you&apos;ll reach Kashima Village. I heard the Daimonists were targeting the divine beast.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6073]=[.I6073]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x21A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>盗人ってのは　ゴートーじゃねえ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">世の中の　カネを　ヘーキンに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ばらまく　だいじな　仕事だ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We thieves aren&apos;t bad guys! We&apos;re spreading wealth all over the world! It&apos;s a very important job!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6074]=[.I6074]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x276_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふるい盗人伝説によると<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">バカな人間はスグにカネを　ため込んで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オニになってしまう　これはコワイ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>According to old thieves&apos; tales, fools who gather too much money turn into demons. Isn&apos;t that scary?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6075]=[.I6075]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x276_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そこで神様が金を世の中ぜんたいに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ばらまくために　盗人をつくったんじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ムニュ　ムニュ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>So God created us thieves to spread wealth from one pocket to many.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6076]=[.I6076]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x32D_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>盗人村は　全国チェーンです<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">安心して　ご利用　ください</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Thief Village is a nation-wide organization. Feel free to use our services!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6077]=[.I6077]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x364_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教の　やつらは　オレたちが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">カネを　ばらまくから</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジャマなんだ！　くやしいぜ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Cult of Daimon is stopping us from spreading the wealth! They&apos;re so annoying!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6078]=[.I6078]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xDB6F-0x3B6_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教は　人々の不幸に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つけこんどる　だから　カネを</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ばらまかれると　困るんじゃな</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Cult of Daimon takes advantage of people&apos;s misfortune. That&apos;s why they don&apos;t want us spreading the wealth.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6079]=[.I6079]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
