     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あっ！　おまえのことしってるぞ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">デマ船妊の出市の次らい屋だな・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">でていけ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hey, I know about you. You&apos;re that brat Gee Ryan who lives with the Dumb Hermit!</text:p>
