     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE103-0x164_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>地下の工場から　逃げて来たんだ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">教会の　さいだんが</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">工場への　入口になって　いるんだ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We escaped from the underground factory! The altar in the church hides a secret path!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6153]=[.I6153]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
