     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE237-0x3F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>それぞれ　ガマ　ナメクジ　ヘビ族の<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族の　勇者が　持つとき</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">真の力を　発するという！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only when held by the Fire Heroes of the three clans will the orbs unleash their true power!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
