     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>邪・・・神・・・・斎に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　たま・・・　ふた・・つ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">・・城　の・・・なかに・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>J-Jashinsai...\n</text:p><text:p>has hidden the orbs...\n</text:p><text:p>in the castle...</text:p>
