    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro29">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6CB-0xC7_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライア殿　生きとるか？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　ホッホッホッ・・・・</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　ワシじゃ　黄門じゃよ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]How are you doing, Ziria-dono?\n</text:p><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]Hoh hoh hoh!\n</text:p><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]It is I, Koumon!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ZenkiTN: Koumon literally went &quot;LOL&quot; on his Edo-era letter</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6432]=[.I6432]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
