     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>水戸城の　空の下から<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">　　　　ぶじを　祈っておるぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]As I look upon the sky\n</text:p><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]above Mito Castle, I will\n</text:p><text:p>[space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px][space8px]pray for your safety.</text:p>
