     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>//==================================</text:p><text:p>// map 0xE6E7</text:p><text:p>//==================================</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x174_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>江戸城</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F6281])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Edo Castle" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Edo Castle</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F6281]); COLUMN([.F6281]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F6281" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F6281</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x25E_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>やっと　会えたのう　ジライアよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この　ガマ仙人は　うれしいぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>At last we meet again, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;ve made this old Toad Hermit proud!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Toad Hermit</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6447]=[.I6447]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x25E_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>もう　涙が　出そうじゃよ・・・<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よくぞ　よくぞ　そこまで　りっぱに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">うれしいぞ　うむ　うれしいぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh, I&apos;m tearing up...\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;ve become such a fine warrior!\n</text:p><text:p>I couldn&apos;t be prouder of you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6448]=[.I6448]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x25E_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>さあ　ショーグンさまが　お待ちじゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゆくが　よい！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Move along, now. The Shogun is waiting for you. Go forth, my boy!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6449]=[.I6449]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x353_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いつか　ジパングが　あぶないとき<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かならず　火の勇者が　ひつようだと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">このナメクジ仙人は　信じておった</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>It has always been my belief that, sooner or later, Jipang would need the Fire Heroes to save it from a great threat.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Slug Hermit</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6450]=[.I6450]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x353_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>だから<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ナメクジ族の　ツナデを　育てたのじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">しかし　これほど　力が　あるとは</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>That is why I trained Tsunade of the Slug clan. But I never would have thought she&apos;d become this strong.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6451]=[.I6451]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x353_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ツナデが　火の勇者として<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">りっぱに　成長したのも</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえの　おかげじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thanks to you, she has become a true Fire Hero. You have my gratitude!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6452]=[.I6452]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x46E_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わたしです　ジライアさま<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ショーグンの娘　月姫です</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-sama! It&apos;s me, Tsukihime, daughter of the Shogun.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tsukihime</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6453]=[.I6453]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x46E_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさまと　オロチ丸と<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデちゃんの　三人の力で</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">平和を　取り戻すことが　できました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria-sama, Orochimaru-sama, Tsunade-chan. Together, you have brought peace back to Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6454]=[.I6454]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x46E_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>月姫は　心より　感しゃ　しています<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You have my eternal gratitude.\n</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6455]=[.I6455]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro11">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x46E_9</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>// WARNING: continues previous box</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ありがとう</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の勇者　ジライアさま！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Thank you...\n</text:p><text:p>O Fire Hero Ziria-sama!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6456]=[.I6456]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x56D_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オー　フレンド　ジライアさん！！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">スバラですね！　大カツヤクですね！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">大門教　ぜんめつデース</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh, friend! Ziria-san!\n</text:p><text:p>You do good! Very great!\n</text:p><text:p>Cult of Daimon is no more!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoteimaru</text:p><text:p>CHECK, Hoteimaru&apos;s accent</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6457]=[.I6457]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x56D_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>デーモンも　滅びました<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">マサカドも　ねむりました</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これで　安心デース</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Demon are gone!\n</text:p><text:p>Masakado sleep again!\n</text:p><text:p>Everyone safe now!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6458]=[.I6458]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x56D_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わたし　あなたの　こと<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いつか　本に　書きます　デース！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I write book about you one day!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6459]=[.I6459]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x668_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">このオロチ丸は　本当に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえに　感しゃしている！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria! You have my utmost gratitude!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Orochimaru</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6460]=[.I6460]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x668_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ショーグンさまの　ニンジャとして<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もうすこしで　大門教に　だまされ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ハジを　かくところだった</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I was almost completely deceived by the Cult of Daimon...As the Shogun&apos;s faithful ninja, I am ashamed of myself.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6461]=[.I6461]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x668_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>こうして　ショーグンさまを　すくえ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わたしの　てがらも　作ってもらえた</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえには　頭が　さがる・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>But you&apos;ve helped me save the Shogun and distinguish myself in his service.\n</text:p><text:p>You have earned my admiration.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6462]=[.I6462]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x668_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>オロチ丸　心より　おまえを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まことの　友だと思っているぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I, Orochimaru, consider you my truest friend!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6463]=[.I6463]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x7CC_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ホッホッホ　わしじゃ　黄門じゃ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あっぱれじゃ　ジライア！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hoh hoh hoh! It is I, Koumon!\n</text:p><text:p>Well done, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Koumon</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6464]=[.I6464]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x7CC_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしも　ショーグンに　たいして<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ハナが　高いぞ！　ホッホッホ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m very proud of the Shogun right now!\n</text:p><text:p>Hoh hoh hoh!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6465]=[.I6465]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x7CC_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おまえたちのことは<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">新しい　伝説として</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">かならず　語りつがれるであろう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I have no doubt that your deeds will soon become a new legend!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6466]=[.I6466]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x8AF_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あくろう王だよ　ジライアさん<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まったく　すげえ　活やくだぜ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これで　ジパングも　平和になる</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>It&apos;s me, King Akurou. You&apos;ve accomplished the impossible, Ziria-san! You&apos;ve brought peace back to Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>King Akurou</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6467]=[.I6467]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x8AF_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わしのムスコも　よろしくとのことじゃ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オニ族も　あんたに　感しゃしとるよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>My son sends his regards. You have the gratitude of the entire Oni clan.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6468]=[.I6468]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おお！　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ふたたび　あえて　うれしいぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ohhh, Ziria! I&apos;m glad to see you again!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Shogun</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6469]=[.I6469]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>このたびの　はたらき　みごとであった<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おまえに　救われた　すべての　人々に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なりかわって　礼を　いうぞ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You have done us all a great service.\n</text:p><text:p>Allow me to thank you on behalf of my people!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6470]=[.I6470]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そちたちが　おらねば<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">このジパングに　平和は　なかった</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ほんとうに　ありがとう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Without you, peace would have never returned to Jipang.\n</text:p><text:p>You have our eternal gratitude!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6471]=[.I6471]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ツナデよ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">オロチ丸よ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Tsunade!\n</text:p><text:p>Orochimaru!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6472]=[.I6472]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_13</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いつの日か　この国が　ふたたび<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">悪霊に　おそわれても</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>One day, our beautiful country may be once again beset by evil.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6473]=[.I6473]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_16</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>人々が　勇気と　愛と　根性を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">忘れない限り</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>But as long as the people hold on to courage, love, and determination...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6474]=[.I6474]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_19</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>神仏を　うやまう　純真な<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">心を　忘れない限り</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>As long as they keep honoring the Gods and Buddha with a pure heart...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6475]=[.I6475]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_22</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ふたたび　火の勇者が　現れて<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">きっと　この国を　守ってくれるだろう</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">わしは　そう思うのじゃ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The Fire Heroes will return once more to protect our country. That is my belief!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6476]=[.I6476]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_25</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ジライアよ！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6477]=[.I6477]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_28</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ツナデよ！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tsunade!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6478]=[.I6478]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_31</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>オロチ丸よ！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Orochimaru!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6479]=[.I6479]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_34</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>人々は　そちたちの　ことを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">けっして　忘れないであろう！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The people of Jipang will never forget you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6480]=[.I6480]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_37</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そして　そちたちの　いぎょうを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">この国の　未来の　子どもたちへ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とわに　言い伝えるであろう！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Your deeds will be handed down throughout the generations for all eternity!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6481]=[.I6481]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_40</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>さあ　おもてを　見るがいい！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Now, look over there!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6482]=[.I6482]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_43</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>江戸の　人たちが　そちたちに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">感しゃの　気持ちを　こめて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">花火を　上げてくれるそうだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The citizens of Edo are setting off fireworks as a display of their gratitude!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6483]=[.I6483]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x96D_46</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>どうれ　みんなで　見るとしよう！！</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come, now -- let us watch them together!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6484]=[.I6484]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xD4F_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>うわー！　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">やったね！！　あたしら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ほんとうに　火の勇者だったね！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Woo-hoo! We actually did it, Ziria!\n</text:p><text:p>Guess we really were the Fire Heroes after all, huh?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tsunade</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6485]=[.I6485]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xD4F_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ツナデ　はじめ　ちょっぴり<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">不安だったんだよ・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I gotta say, I wasn&apos;t so sure about you at first...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6486]=[.I6486]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xD4F_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>でも　あんたの勇気に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">感動しちゃったよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>But your courage got to me!\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;re cool in my book!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6487]=[.I6487]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xD4F_10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>これからも　お友だちで<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いようね！　ジライア！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;re BFFs now! Right, Ziria?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6488]=[.I6488]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xE4F_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>へへへ！　なまぐさ　ですよ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">まったく　すげえことを　やったね</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Heh heh heh! It&apos;s me, Corrupt!\n</text:p><text:p>You&apos;re really something else!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Corrupt priest</text:p><text:p>CHECK, corrupt priest name</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6489]=[.I6489]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xE4F_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>たった　３人ですよ・・・<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングを　すくっちまうなんて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おどろき　もものき　ですぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hard to believe you kids would actually save Jipang...Color me impressed!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6490]=[.I6490]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xE4F_7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれも　あんたの　手伝いが<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">できて　うれしいですぜ！！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ナンマイダブ　ナンマイダブ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Well, I&apos;m glad I managed to help along the way! Namo Amitabha, Namo Amitabha...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6491]=[.I6491]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xF54_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさま！　ありがとうござった<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">さあさあ　どうぞ　どうぞ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ショーグンさまがおまちです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Thank you so much, Ziria-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>The Shogun is waiting for you!\n</text:p><text:p>Don&apos;t be shy!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>unnamed NPC</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6492]=[.I6492]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xFB0_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おお　ジライアどので　ござるか！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そちの　ウワサは　この国じゅうに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">広まって　おりますぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Oh, you must be Ziria-dono!\n</text:p><text:p>Word about you has been spreading throughout the land!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>samurai-looking man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6493]=[.I6493]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0xFB0_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教は　わしら武士の力を<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">持ってしても　歯の立たぬ相手じゃった</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ありがとうござった！　ジライア殿！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I&apos;m ashamed to admit that we samurai were no match for the Cult of Daimon.\n</text:p><text:p>You have our gratitude, Ziria-dono!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6494]=[.I6494]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x106F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>わたしが　生きている間に<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングの　平和が　ふたたび</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">見られるとは　うれしいのう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I never thought I&apos;d be able to see peace return to Jipang in my lifetime.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>an old woman</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6495]=[.I6495]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x106F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ほんに　これも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさまの　おかげじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ありがとう　ごぜえますだ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I have you to thank for this, Ziria-sama. Thank you so much!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6496]=[.I6496]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x110A_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんさんが　ジライアはんでっか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">話は　よう　きいとりまっせ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">たいした　お方でんなあ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>You&apos;re that Ziria boy I&apos;ve heard about, huh? Amazing work!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6497]=[.I6497]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x110A_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あんさんの　おかげで　あきないも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">安心して　できまっさ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">えろう　おおきに！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Now I can go back to my business without worrying about those weirdos!\n</text:p><text:p>Thanks a bunch!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6498]=[.I6498]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x11A9_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おサエです！　ジライアさま！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　お会いできて　しあわせです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria-sama! It&apos;s me, Osae!\n</text:p><text:p>It&apos;s so nice to see you again!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Osae</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6499]=[.I6499]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x11A9_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いつか　きっと　もがみの渡しに<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いらして　くださいね</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ずっと　お待ちして　おります</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Come visit me at Mogami Ferry someday! I&apos;ll be waiting for you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6500]=[.I6500]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x124E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさまで　ないの！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あらあ　大門教を　たおしただけあって</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いい男だ　こと！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You must be the real Ziria-sama, the hero who defeated the Cult of Daimon!\n</text:p><text:p>My, you&apos;re such a cutie!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a woman</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6501]=[.I6501]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x124E_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>みんな　あんたに　感しゃしてるわよ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　なにか　あったら</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よろしく　たのむわね！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We&apos;re very grateful for what you&apos;ve done for us. I know who to call if I ever need help!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6502]=[.I6502]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x12F3_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おカヨです　ジライアさま！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あなたの　おかげで</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　お坊さまと　デートしています</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria-sama! It&apos;s me, Okayo!\n</text:p><text:p>Thanks to you, I&apos;ve been able to go on more dates with my beloved monk.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Okayo</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6503]=[.I6503]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x12F3_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>あたらしい　カンザシも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">もらいました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Look! He gave me a new hairpin!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6504]=[.I6504]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x137E_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大工のトウベイですよ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">タマモ退治のときは　ほんとうに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おせわに　なりました・・・</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>It&apos;s me, Toubei the carpenter!\n</text:p><text:p>Thanks again for dealing with Tamamohime for us.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Toubei the Carpenter</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6505]=[.I6505]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x137E_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>白河の　大トノさまからも<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">くれぐれも　よろしくとのことです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The lord of Shirakawa sends his regards.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6506]=[.I6506]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro6">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x140F_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>ポンポコリン</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ponpokorin!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tanuki emissary</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6507]=[.I6507]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro4">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x140F_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>私は筑波からきた<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">タヌキです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I&apos;m a tanuki from Tsukuba.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6508]=[.I6508]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x140F_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大ダヌキさまや　金太にたのまれ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">一言　お礼をいいに　こっそりと</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">人間に化けて　やってきました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I disguised myself as a human to bring you a few words of thanks from Oodanuki-sama and Kinta.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6509]=[.I6509]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x140F_6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさま！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">本当に　ありがとうございました</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">これで　安心して山でくらせます</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thank you for everything, Ziria-sama! Now we can live in peace on our mountain!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6510]=[.I6510]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x14E8_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いやー　アッパレ　アッパレ！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よくぞ　ジパングを　大門教から</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">救って　くれた！　礼をいうぞ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Well done, well done!\n</text:p><text:p>Allow me to thank you for saving Jipang from those evil Daimonists!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>another samurai-looking man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6511]=[.I6511]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x14E8_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>そちの　はたらきに　たいし　ほうびを<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">とらせたいところだが　あいにく　手に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">なにもない　許せよ　ワハハッハッハ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>You deserve a reward for your service!\n</text:p><text:p>Unfortunately, I&apos;m not carrying anything worthy of your deed! Sorry! Wahahaha!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6512]=[.I6512]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x15B5_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさまの　その勇気と　力<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">そして　正義感には　われわれ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">しょ民は　深く　おそれ入るのみです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We common folk are filled with awe by your great courage, might, and sense of justice, Ziria-sama.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>an old man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6513]=[.I6513]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x15B5_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジパングに　真の平和を　もたらした<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさまを　われわれは</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">長く　たたえていくことでしょう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We will never forget you for bringing true peace to our beautiful Jipang.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6514]=[.I6514]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x1676_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>キャー！　ウワサのジライアさまだわ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジパングの危機を救った　お方に</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">はなし　かけられちゃった！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Eeep! It&apos;s the real Ziria-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>The hero of Jipang just talked to me!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a girl</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6515]=[.I6515]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x16DA_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>いやいやいや　まったくもう<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">何と　いってよいやら　ジライアさまの</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">活やくには　頭が　下がる　思いです</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Well, I can only bow my head to you, Ziria-sama! You&apos;re really something else!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6516]=[.I6516]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x16DA_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　たおしちまうなんざ<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">並の　お方ではないねぇ　イヨッ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホントに　ありがとうございました</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>We thought defeating the Cult of Daimon was impossible, but you proved us all wrong! We&apos;ll never thank you enough!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6517]=[.I6517]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x17A1_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアの　にいちゃん！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ついに　大門教を　やっつけたんだね</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ホントに　ありがとう！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Thanks for beating the bad guys, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a kid</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6518]=[.I6518]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x17A1_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ボクも　大きくなったら<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアの　にいちゃん　みたいに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">強くて　ゆうかんな人になるんだ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When I grow up, I wanna be a hero like you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6519]=[.I6519]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x1850_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ほう！　あなたが　ジライアさまか！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">あんたの　おかげで　ジパングにも</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">本物の　平和が　やってきました！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>I see -- so you&apos;re Ziria-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>Thank you for bringing true peace back to Jipang!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>some old man</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6520]=[.I6520]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x1850_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>これで　わしのような　ジジイの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">余生も　安心して　くらせそうじゃ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">めでたし　めでたし　じゃのう！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>I get to spend the remaining years of my life without a worry, and nothing could make me happier!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6521]=[.I6521]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x191B_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>雲切だよ　ジライア！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">本当の　火の勇者に　なったねえ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おれが　思った　通りだぜ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Ziria! It&apos;s me, Kumogiri!\n</text:p><text:p>Looks like the legends were true, huh? You&apos;re a real Fire Hero!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Kumogiri</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6522]=[.I6522]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x191B_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おれは　うれしくて　うれしくて<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">雲切の里の　みんなも　あんたに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">よろしく　いってたぜ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The men and women from my hamlets send their regards!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6523]=[.I6523]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x19D7_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>ジライアさま　おかげで<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">安心して　農作物を　作れますだ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">お礼の　ことばも　ねえですだよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Thank you, Ziria-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>I can tend to my crops in peace and quiet!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>a guy</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6524]=[.I6524]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE6E7-0x19D7_2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce4" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>きっと　田んぼのイネも　畑の作物も<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ジライアさまに　お礼を　いってるに</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ちげえねえだよ</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce7" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If they could talk, I bet every single crop on my field would also be thanking you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
