     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>マサカドさま　はやく<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">一刻も　早く　目覚めてください</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族が　間近まで　迫っています</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>O Masakado-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>You must wake up soon!\n</text:p><text:p>The Fire Heroes are approaching!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
