     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xE735-0x151_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>多賀城の　あくろう王も<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いまごろ　心を　いれかえて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">また　大門教に　入ったでしょう</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>By now, King Akurou of Taga Castle must be considering coming back among us.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6567]=[.I6567]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
