     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F6541])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="O Masakado-sama!\n&#x0a;There is no time left!\n&#x0a;The Fire Heroes are coming!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>O Masakado-sama!\n</text:p><text:p>There is no time left!\n</text:p><text:p>The Fire Heroes are coming!</text:p>
