    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xF393-0xC9_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>おぬしが　ジライアか！？<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ちかごろ　ちまたで　チヤホヤされて</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">つけあがっと　うつけものめが</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>So you&apos;re Ziria...You must love all the attention you&apos;re getting these days, huh? You spoiled brat!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6722]=[.I6722]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xF393-0xC9_4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>火の勇者など　この　ジュウベイの<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">必殺剣が　打ちくだいて　くれるわ！</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">いざ　勝負じゃ！！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3409])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="The so-called {Fire Hero} will never be able to stand against my lethal technique! Have at you!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>The so-called {Fire Hero} will never be able to stand against my lethal technique! Have at you!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F3409]); COLUMN([.F3409]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F3409" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F3409</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xF393-0x191_1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>はっはっは！　それみたことか！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族など　しょせん</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おくびょうもの　集まりよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hah! I knew it!\n</text:p><text:p>The Fire Clan consists of nothing but pathetic cowards!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce8"/>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=IF([.F6724]=[.I6724]; &quot;UNTRANSLATED&quot;; &quot;&quot;)">
      <text:p/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1016"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xF393-0x1EB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　たおせるのは　おぬししか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おらん！　まよわず　自分の道を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゆくのじゃ　ジライアよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3411])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Only you can stop the Cult of Daimon. Keep following your path with unwavering confidence, Ziria!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only you can stop the Cult of Daimon. Keep following your path with unwavering confidence, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
