     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>はっはっは！　それみたことか！<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">火の一族など　しょせん</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おくびょうもの　集まりよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F6724])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Hah! I knew it!\n&#x0a;The Fire Clan consists of nothing but pathetic cowards!" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>Hah! I knew it!\n</text:p><text:p>The Fire Clan consists of nothing but pathetic cowards!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=&quot;DUPE: &quot;&amp;ADDRESS(ROW([.F6724]); COLUMN([.F6724]); 4)" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="DUPE: F6724" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>DUPE: F6724</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="1017"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro3">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>string</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>map-0xF3AD-0x1EB_0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce2" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p>大門教を　たおせるのは　おぬししか<text:span text:style-name="T1">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">おらん！　まよわず　自分の道を</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">\n</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T2">ゆくのじゃ　ジライアよ！</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:formula="of:=T([.F3411])" office:value-type="string" office:string-value="Only you can stop the Cult of Daimon. Keep following your path with unwavering confidence, Ziria!" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Only you can stop the Cult of Daimon. Keep following your path with unwavering confidence, Ziria!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
